 迁移与差异。","locale":"zh-CN"},"192":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-55","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#推理强度","content":"只有调用方明确给出档位时，网关才会改写请求：","locale":"zh-CN"},"193":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-56","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#推理强度","content":"Chat Completions 的 `reasoning_effort`，或 Responses 风格的 `reasoning.effort`；","locale":"zh-CN"},"194":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-57","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#推理强度","content":"没有给出档位时请求体原样发送，调用方自己设置的 `max_tokens` 保持不变。Playground 的 **自动（服务端默认）** 不发送档位。","locale":"zh-CN"},"195":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-58","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#推理强度","content":"原生 Anthropic Messages 请求（直接转发到支持 Messages 的上游时）保留调用方自己的 thinking 和输出设置，不经过这里的规则。","locale":"zh-CN"},"196":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-59","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#推理强度","content":"给出档位后，按模型分三种情况：","locale":"zh-CN"},"197":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-60","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#推理强度","content":"模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"198":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-61","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#推理强度","content":"处理方式","locale":"zh-CN"},"199":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-62","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#推理强度","content":"有自己的档位菜单（`efforts` 不为空）","locale":"zh-CN"},"200":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-63","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#推理强度","content":"选出档位，把这个模型声明的补丁合并进请求体（例如写入 `reasoning_effort`，或 `thinking`、`output_config.effort`）；`max_tokens` 设为模型输出上限与调用方上限中较小的一个","locale":"zh-CN"},"201":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-64","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text"