age_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#推理强度","content":"菜单模型经过上面的对应后仍然找不到档位时，使用它的默认档位；阶梯模型收到不认识的档位时使用 `balanced`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"225":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-88","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#推理强度","content":"菜单模型请求中原有的 `reasoning_effort`、`reasoning` 字段，如果不在补丁里，会被移除；`max_completion_tokens` 统一换成 `max_tokens`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"226":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-89","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#推理强度","content":"不能关闭思考的模型（`can_disable_thinking` 为 `false`），阶梯上限加倍，因为思考和回答共用同一个上限。","locale":"zh-CN"},"227":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-90","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#推理强度","content":"阶梯的实际上限还会被模型的输出上限和调用方自己更小的 `max_tokens` 进一步压低，但最低 512；所以明确选择档位时，低于 512 的调用方上限会被提高到 512。菜单模型最低为 1。","locale":"zh-CN"},"228":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-91","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#推理强度","content":"阶梯模型的 `reasoning_effort` 和 `reasoning` 字段会被移除，因为上游并不执行它们，只有 `max_tokens` 起作用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"229":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-92","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#推理强度","content":"各站点的菜单写法不同：例如 Kilo 用 `reasoning` 对象，MiniMax 和 ZCode 用 `output_config.effort`，CodeArts 用 `thinking.type`，Raccoon 用 `extra_body.thinking`，Gemini Code Assist 的 `gemini-3.8-flash` 提供 `low`、`medium`、`high`、`tiered`（由模型自己决定）。不要假设所有模型都有同样的档位，用 `GET /api/v1/models` 查看每个 id 的 `efforts` 和每一档对应的上限。","locale":"zh-CN"},"230":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-93","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#可用性探测","content":"有些渠道的模型列表只是一串 id，说不出这个出口实际能用哪些模型。探测用最小的请求（发送 `ping`，最多 64 个 token）逐个问一遍。","locale":"zh-CN"},"231":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-94","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#可用性探测","content":"在 **模型** 页点 **探测**，或调用管理接口：","locale":"zh-CN"},"232":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-95","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#可用性探测","content":"不指定模型时探测 `opencode`、`nvidia` 和 `agg` 这几个列表无法说明可用性的渠道。Kilo 的免费列表已经由上游筛选过，不在默认范围内。","locale":"zh-CN"},"233":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-96","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#可用性探测","content":"探测在后台进行，同时最多 2 个，每个最多等 45 秒。已有一轮在进行时，再次发起不会叠加，返回 `started: false`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"234":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-97","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#可用性探测","content":"无法解析的模型名放在返回的 `unresolved` 中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"235":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-98","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#可用性探测","content":"结果保存在 `hoshimi.db` 中，重启后仍在，并附在 **模型** 页和 `GET /api/v1/models` 的每一行上。","locale":"zh-CN"},"236":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-99","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#可用性探测","content":"结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"237":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-100","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#可用性探测","content":"界面显示","locale":"zh-CN"},"238":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-101","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#可用性探测","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"239":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-102","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#可用性探测","content":"`available`","locale":"zh-CN"},"240":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-103","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#可用性探测","content":"可用","locale":"zh-CN"},"241":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-104","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#可用性探测","content":"模型产生了内容或 token","locale":"zh-CN"},"242":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-105","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#可用性探测","content":"`region-blocked`","locale":"zh-CN"},"243":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-106","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#可用性探测","content":"地区受限","locale":"zh-CN"},"244":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-107","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#可用性探测","content":"这个出口所在的地区被拒绝","locale":"zh-CN"},"245":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-108","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#可用性探测","content":"`unavailable`","locale":"zh-CN"},"246":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-109","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#可用性探测","content":"不可用","locale":"zh-CN"},"247":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-110","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#可用性探测","content":"针对这个模型的拒绝","locale":"zh-CN"},"248":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-111","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#可用性探测","content":"`throttled`","locale":"zh-CN"},"249":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-112","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#可用性探测","content":"限流","locale":"zh-CN"},"250":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-113","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#可用性探测","content":"额度不足，没能问到模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"251":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-114","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#可用性探测","content":"`unknown`","locale":"zh-CN"},"252":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-115","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#可用性探测","content":"未知","locale":"zh-CN"},"253":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-116","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#可用性探测","content":"凭据、网络或服务器出错，无法判断模型本身","locale":"zh-CN"},"254":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-117","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#可用性探测","content":"只有 `unavailable` 是关于模型本身的结论；地区、额度和未知的结果都不说明模型不存在。Playground 为图片寻找描述模型时，会跳过 `unavailable` 和 `region-blocked` 的模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"255":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-118","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#记住失效的模型","content":"正常请求中，网关也会记住上游说“没有这个模型”的情况：","locale":"zh-CN"},"256":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-119","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#记住失效的模型","content":"HTTP `404` 或 `410`，或 `400`、`405`、`406`、`415`、`418`、`422`、`451` 的响应正文明确说模型不存在（如 `model not found`、`does not exist`、`不存在`、`已下线`），算作一次“这个模型失效”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"257":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-120","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#记住失效的模型","content":"正文同时提到额度、限流、余额、未登录、凭据等账号问题时不算；`401`、`402`、`429` 和 `5xx` 无论正文说什么都不算。","locale":"zh-CN"},"258":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-121","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#记住失效的模型","content":"渠道中被问到的账号都这样回答，才记一次。","locale":"zh-CN"},"259":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-122","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#记住失效的模型","content":"记下之后：","locale":"zh-CN"},"260":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-123","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#记住失效的模型","content":"从第一次记录起 10 分钟内，对这个模型的请求直接返回 `503 model_unavailable`（`… is temporarily unavailable: the station stopped answering for it.`），不再访问上游；","locale":"zh-CN"},"261":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-124","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#记住失效的模型","content":"10 分钟内累计 3 次，变为本次运行期间一直失效；","locale":"zh-CN"},"262":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-125","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#记住失效的模型","content":"模型重新正常回答时清除记录；","locale":"zh-CN"},"263":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-126","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#记住失效的模型","content":"`POST /api/v1/models/unavailable/reset` 或重启服务器清除所有记录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"264":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-127","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#记住失效的模型","content":"这份记录只在内存中，与保存在数据库里的探测结果不同。被记为失效的模型在 **模型** 页和 `GET /api/v1/models` 中标为 `unavailable`，但不一定从列表中消失。","locale":"zh-CN"},"265":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-128","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#账号轮换与重试","content":"一个渠道有多个账号时，请求从第一个可用的账号开始；跳过需要重新登录和正在暂停轮换的账号。失败后按失败的类型决定下一步：","locale":"zh-CN"},"266":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-129","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#账号轮换与重试","content":"失败类型","locale":"zh-CN"},"267":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-130","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#账号轮换与重试","content":"典型的上游回答","locale":"zh-CN"},"268":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-131","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#账号轮换与重试","content":"网关的做法","locale":"zh-CN"},"269":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-132","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#账号轮换与重试","content":"凭据被拒","locale":"zh-CN"},"270":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-133","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#账号轮换与重试","content":"`401`，或正文是凭据问题的 `403`","locale":"zh-CN"},"271":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-134","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#账号轮换与重试","content":"先尝试刷新这个账号的令牌，刷新成功就用它重试；否则换下一个账号","locale":"zh-CN"},"272":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-135","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#账号轮换与重试","content":"权限不足","locale":"zh-CN"},"273":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-136","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#账号轮换与重试","content":"正文不是凭据问题的 `403`","locale":"zh-CN"},"274":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-137","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#账号轮换与重试","content":"不换账号，直接返回","locale":"zh-CN"},"275":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-138","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#账号轮换与重试","content":"额度或限流","locale":"zh-CN"},"276":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-139","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#账号轮换与重试","content":"`402`、`429`，或正文提到额度、限流、余额不足","locale":"zh-CN"},"277":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-140","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#账号轮换与重试","content":"把这个账号暂停轮换，然后换下一个账号","locale":"zh-CN"},"278":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-141","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#账号轮换与重试","content":"策略拦截","locale":"zh-CN"},"279":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-142","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#账号轮换与重试","content":"CodeBuddy 业务码 `11140`，或“安全审核”等","locale":"zh-CN"},"280":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-143","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#账号轮换与重试","content":"暂停这个账号 30 分钟，不刷新令牌，换下一个账号","locale":"zh-CN"},"281":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-144","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#账号轮换与重试","content":"模型饱和","locale":"zh-CN"},"282":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-145","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#账号轮换与重试","content":"CodeBuddy 业务码 `14003`（只提供 `SWITCH_MODEL`），或“模型繁忙”等","locale":"zh-CN"},"283":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-146","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#账号轮换与重试","content":"不换账号，直接把上游的说明返回给调用方：所有账号都会遇到同样的情况","locale":"zh-CN"},"284":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-147","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#账号轮换与重试","content":"模型不存在","locale":"zh-CN"},"285":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-148","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#账号轮换与重试","content":"`404`、`410` 等（见上一节）","locale":"zh-CN"},"286":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-149","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#账号轮换与重试","content":"继续问其他账号；全部如此时记为失效","locale":"zh-CN"},"287":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-150","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#账号轮换与重试","content":"可恢复的错误","locale":"zh-CN"},"288":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-151","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#账号轮换与重试","content":"`408`、`409`、`425`、`500`、`502`、`503`、`504`、`507`、Cloudflare `521`–`527`、Anthropic `529`，以及不在任何表中的状态码","locale":"zh-CN"},"289":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-152","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#账号轮换与重试","content":"换下一个账号","locale":"zh-CN"},"290":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-153","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#账号轮换与重试","content":"请求本身的问题","locale":"zh-CN"},"291":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-154","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#账号轮换与重试","content":"`400`、`405`、`406`、`415`、`418`、`422`、`451`","locale":"zh-CN"},"292":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-155","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#账号轮换与重试","content":"不换账号，直接返回：换哪个账号都一样","locale":"zh-CN"},"293":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-156","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#账号轮换与重试","content":"规则：","locale":"zh-CN"},"294":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-157","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#账号轮换与重试","content":"一个请求最多尝试 `server.max_account_retries`（默认 3）个不同的账号。","locale":"zh-CN"},"295":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-158","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#账号轮换与重试","content":"**额度暂停**的时长：优先用响应头 `Retry-After`，其次用正文中写明的重置时间（如 `将在 2026-09-11 18:08:17 UTC+8 重置`、`reset at … UTC+8`，按其中的时区换算），都没有时暂停 1 小时。已有的暂停不会被缩短。","locale":"zh-CN"},"296":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-159","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#账号轮换与重试","content":"账号都问过了，而最后一次失败是可恢复的错误（不是凭据、额度、策略或模型不存在）时，等一会儿再从头试一轮，最多两次。等待时间优先用 `Retry-After` 或正文中的重置时间，最长 8 秒；`Retry-After: 0` 表示立即重试。没有时间时随机等待（上限从 0.25 秒起翻倍，最长 8 秒）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"297":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-160","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#账号轮换与重试","content":"**已经向调用方输出了内容的请求，绝不会自动重放**，以免同一段回答出现两次。","locale":"zh-CN"},"298":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-161","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#账号轮换与重试","content":"渠道里没有任何可以尝试的账号（都需要登录或都在暂停中）时，返回 `502`：`Provider '…' exhausted all accounts.`","locale":"zh-CN"},"299":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-162","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#账号轮换与重试","content":"暂停轮换的账号和原因显示在 **渠道** 页（**暂停中**，如 **被限流**、**被策略阻止**）和 `GET /api/v1/credits` 的 `cooled` 中。暂停记录只在内存中，重启后清空。","locale":"zh-CN"},"300":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-163","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#凭据续期","content":"带有刷新令牌的账号由续期定时器维护（`server.auto_refresh`）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"301":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-164","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#凭据续期","content":"启动 30 秒后第一轮，之后每 30 分钟一轮；","locale":"zh-CN"},"302":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-165","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#凭据续期","content":"每轮续期 1 小时内到期的账号；没有记录过期时间的账号每轮都续期；","locale":"zh-CN"},"303":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-166","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#凭据续期","content":"续期成功后，新的令牌只写回 `config.json` 中对应的那一个账号；","locale":"zh-CN"},"304":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-167","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#凭据续期","content":"上游拒绝刷新令牌本身（如 `invalid_grant`，或没有说明原因的 `401`）时，账号被标为 **需要登录**，不再参与轮换，直到重新登录；其他失败下一轮再试。单纯的 `403` 不会让账号作废。","locale":"zh-CN"},"305":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-168","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#凭据续期","content":"请求中遇到凭据被拒时也会立即续期一次。续期状态和手动续期：","locale":"zh-CN"},"306":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-169","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#凭据续期","content":"`force` 表示不管是否快到期都续期；标为需要登录的账号即使 `force` 也会跳过。网页上对应 **渠道** 页的 **立即续期** 和 **续期所有账户**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"307":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-170","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#余额和签到","content":"`GET /api/v1/credits` 读取各账号的余额、暂停轮换的账号和签到状态；`POST /api/v1/credits/claim`（可带 `{\"provider\": \"…\"}`）立即签到；`GET /api/v1/credits/checkins` 列出签到历史。没有余额或签到接口的渠道会被跳过。","locale":"zh-CN"},"308":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-171","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#余额和签到","content":"开启 `server.auto_checkin` 时，启动 30 秒后进行第一轮签到，之后每 24 小时一轮。签到按北京时间（UTC+8）的日历日计算；当天已有账号签到成功（或站点回答今天已签过）后，同一天不再重复。签到逐个账号依次进行，不并发，以免触发站点的风控。每次结果（定时的和手动的）都记入 365 天的历史。","locale":"zh-CN"},"309":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-172","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#被动额度","content":"上游的每个回答都可能带着额度信息。网关在推理请求的响应头里读取剩余量和上限，不额外发请求。按下面的顺序，取第一对能解析的：","locale":"zh-CN"},"310":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-173","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#被动额度","content":"剩余量","locale":"zh-CN"},"311":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-174","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#被动额度","content":"上限","locale":"zh-CN"},"312":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-175","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#被动额度","content":"`x-ratelimit-remaining-requests`","locale":"zh-CN"},"313":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-176","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#被动额度","content":"`x-ratelimit-limit-requests`","locale":"zh-CN"},"314":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-177","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#被动额度","content":"`x-ratelimit-remaining`","locale":"zh-CN"},"315":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-178","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#被动额度","content":"`x-ratelimit-limit`","locale":"zh-CN"},"316":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-179","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#被动额度","content":"`ratelimit-remaining-requests`","locale":"zh-CN"},"317":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-180","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#被动额度","content":"`ratelimit-limit-requests`","locale":"zh-CN"},"318":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-181","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#被动额度","content":"`ratelimit-remaining`","locale":"zh-CN"},"319":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-182","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#被动额度","content":"`ratelimit-limit`","locale":"zh-CN"},"320":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-183","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#被动额度","content":"`x-ratelimit-remaining-requests-day`","locale":"zh-CN"},"321":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-184","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#被动额度","content":"`x-ratelimit-limit-requests-day`","locale":"zh-CN"},"322":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-185","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#被动额度","content":"`x-ratelimit-remaining-day`","locale":"zh-CN"},"323":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-186","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#被动额度","content":"`x-ratelimit-limit-day`","locale":"zh-CN"},"324":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-187","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#被动额度","content":"数值解析是严格的：`10 requests` 不会被读成 10。剩余量和上限两个头都在、却没有一对能解析时，记一次“表头无法解析”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"325":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-188","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#被动额度","content":"百分比限制在 0–100；读数超过 5 分钟视为过时。","locale":"zh-CN"},"326":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-189","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#被动额度","content":"每个渠道另有四个计数：响应总数、`401`/`403`、`429`、`5xx`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"327":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-190","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#被动额度","content":"**渠道** 页显示读数：10% 及以下为红色，25% 及以下为琥珀色，过时的读数标为 **（旧）**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"328":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-191","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#被动额度","content":"读数按渠道（不是按账号）记录，只在内存中，记录失败也不会影响推理。管理接口只返回表头名称，不返回原始值。","locale":"zh-CN"},"329":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","type":"page","content":"pi-free 迁移与差异","breadcrumbs":["Hoshimi 文档","进阶"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","locale":"zh-CN"},"330":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-0","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","content":"Hoshimi 与 pi-free 的关系：从 pi-free 搬过来时要做什么，哪些站点规则照搬了，哪些刻意没有照搬，以及运行时行为的差异。","locale":"zh-CN"},"331":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-1","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#从-pi-free-搬过来","content":"从 pi-free 搬过来","locale":"zh-CN"},"332":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-2","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#凭据要重新放进-hoshimi","content":"凭据要重新放进 Hoshimi","locale":"zh-CN"},"333":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-3","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#聚合站点添加-agg-账号","content":"聚合站点：添加 agg 账号","locale":"zh-CN"},"334":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-4","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#需要登录的站点重新登录","content":"需要登录的站点：重新登录","locale":"zh-CN"},"335":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-5","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#用原生的模型-id","content":"用原生的模型 id","locale":"zh-CN"},"336":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-6","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#模型目录的过滤","content":"模型目录的过滤","locale":"zh-CN"},"337":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-7","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#免费标记","content":"免费标记","locale":"zh-CN"},"338":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-8","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#能力与模型选择","content":"能力与模型选择","locale":"zh-CN"},"339":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-9","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#运行时的差异","content":"运行时的差异","locale":"zh-CN"},"340":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-10","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","content":"pi-free 是 Hoshimi 的重要参考：许多站点的接入方式、模型目录的过滤规则和免费标记都转录自它。但它不是运行时依赖，Hoshimi 也不读取 pi-free 的配置。pi 和 free-claude-code 同样只是迁移时的参考。本页说明从 pi-free 搬过来的步骤，以及两者行为上的差别。","locale":"zh-CN"},"341":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-11","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#凭据要重新放进-hoshimi","content":"pi-free 从环境变量（如 `ZENMUX_API_KEY`）读取站点密钥；Hoshimi **不会**自动读取这些变量，所有凭据都保存在 Hoshimi 自己的账号配置中。`hoshimi stations` 列出的 **Key env** 一列只是说明上游的惯例，方便你找到原来的密钥。","locale":"zh-CN"},"342":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-12","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#聚合站点添加-agg-账号","content":"pi-free 中通过 API 密钥接入的站点，在 Hoshimi 中是 `agg` 渠道的账号。用 `preset` 指定站点，不用写地址：","locale":"zh-CN"},"343":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-13","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#聚合站点添加-agg-账号","content":"也可以在网页的 **渠道** 页打开 agg，点 **添加账号**，从 **站点** 列表中选择。全部 22 个预设见 agg 聚合渠道。","locale":"zh-CN"},"344":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-14","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#需要登录的站点重新登录","content":"Cline、Qoder、ZCode 等通过浏览器登录的站点，用 `hoshimi login <渠道>` 或网页上的 **登录** 重新登录一次，见免费站点。","locale":"zh-CN"},"345":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-15","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#用原生的模型-id","content":"Hoshimi 保留各站点原生的渠道 id 和模型 id。客户端里用 `渠道/模型` 指定，或只写模型 id 由网关查找，见模型与账号行为。","locale":"zh-CN"},"346":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-16","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#用原生的模型-id","content":"各渠道的来源 id、端点、协议、凭据类型和覆盖情况记录在渠道来源清单中。清单中的快照 id 描述的是当时参考的源码版本，不代表上游的最新版本，也不代表实际接入测试的结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"347":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-17","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#模型目录的过滤","content":"站点的 `/models` 列表里除了聊天模型，常常还有图像和视频生成、向量、重排序、语音转写等端点。`agg` 按站点逐行判断哪些是聊天模型：","locale":"zh-CN"},"348":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-18","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#模型目录的过滤","content":"**按地址识别站点**，而不是按预设名：账号写了 `preset: sambanova` 却把 `base_url` 指向别处，读到的就不是 SambaNova 的目录，不会套用它的规则。不在预设地址表中的地址（包括你自己的中继）不做过滤。","locale":"zh-CN"},"349":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-19","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#模型目录的过滤","content":"10 个站点的过滤规则从 pi-free 转录：Agnes、B.AI、DeepInfra、FastRouter、Novita、OrcaRouter、Routeway、TokenRouter、XKiro、ZenMux。","locale":"zh-CN"},"350":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-20","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#模型目录的过滤","content":"**LLM7 用的是 Hoshimi 自己的规则**：按行中的 `model_type` 只保留 `chat`。只看输出是否为文本不够：`whisper-large-v3`（语音转写）和 `gpt-image-2`（同时输出文本和图片）都会被误收。","locale":"zh-CN"},"351":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-21","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#模型目录的过滤","content":"行里缺少用来判断的字段时，保留这一行（Novita 例外，它的 `status` 和 `model_type` 是站点自己的约定）。这样上游改了格式时，不会悄悄丢掉整个目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"352":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-22","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#模型目录的过滤","content":"pi-free 为 LLM7 本地构造的 `default`、`fast`、`pro` 路由选择器没有加入：它们不是站点真实的模型列表，而且当时的探测也没能证明它们可以匿名使用。这是设计上的历史原因，不是对端点现状的报告。","locale":"zh-CN"},"353":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-23","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#免费标记","content":"Hoshimi 的 `free` 有三个值：`true`、`false` 和 `null`（站点没有说明），不知道和收费是两回事。22 个预设中有 9 个能给出答案：","locale":"zh-CN"},"354":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-24","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#免费标记","content":"站点","locale":"zh-CN"},"355":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-25","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#免费标记","content":"依据","locale":"zh-CN"},"356":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-26","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#免费标记","content":"B.AI、TokenRouter","locale":"zh-CN"},"357":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-27","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#免费标记","content":"带 `:free` 后缀的 id；B.AI 另有价格页上列为免费的几个 id","locale":"zh-CN"},"358":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-28","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#免费标记","content":"GMI","locale":"zh-CN"},"359":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-29","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#免费标记","content":"行中的 `is_free`","locale":"zh-CN"},"360":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-30","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#免费标记","content":"XKiro","locale":"zh-CN"},"361":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-31","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#免费标记","content":"行中的 `access_tier`，其次是名称中的 free 和价格","locale":"zh-CN"},"362":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-32","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#免费标记","content":"AnyAPI、OrcaRouter","locale":"zh-CN"},"363":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-33","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#免费标记","content":"行中的 `isFree`，其次是名称中的 free 和价格","locale":"zh-CN"},"364":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-34","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#免费标记","content":"OpenGateway","locale":"zh-CN"},"365":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-35","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#免费标记","content":"行中的价格（优惠价优先）","locale":"zh-CN"},"366":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-36","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#免费标记","content":"Agnes、CommandCode","locale":"zh-CN"},"367":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-37","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#免费标记","content":"站点价格文档中列为免费的 id（列表本身不带价格）","locale":"zh-CN"},"368":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-38","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#免费标记","content":"刻意没有照搬的：","locale":"zh-CN"},"369":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-39","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#免费标记","content":"pi-free 在发现站点有任何一行带价格后，就把没有价格的行一律当作收费。Hoshimi 不这样做，没有价格就是 `null`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"370":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-40","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#免费标记","content":"Venice 把一些模型标为 0 价格，但它要求账户有正余额，未充值的密钥会收到 HTTP 402，所以不把 0 价格当作免费。","locale":"zh-CN"},"371":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-41","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#免费标记","content":"LLM7 为每一行都标价，那是标价而不是账户能否免费使用的说明。","locale":"zh-CN"},"372":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-42","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#免费标记","content":"免费标记不保证有额度，也不保证每个密钥都能访问。站点的限时免费活动结束后，标记可能过时，但只会少一个标记，不会多出一个错误的承诺。","locale":"zh-CN"},"373":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-43","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#能力与模型选择","content":"CommandCode 自己的视觉、推理能力列表保留了下来，账号中的声明优先于它。它的收费价格表和默认输出上限没有导入。","locale":"zh-CN"},"374":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-44","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#能力与模型选择","content":"models.dev 只为没有任何声明的模型补充视觉和推理两项；上下文长度、输出上限和推理档位必须描述实际使用的端点，不从那里取。","locale":"zh-CN"},"375":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-45","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#能力与模型选择","content":"Artificial Analysis 的基准分数快照和按模型名模糊匹配的排名没有导入。Hoshimi 只路由调用方请求的模型；模型失败时记录下来，而不是悄悄换成排名更高的另一个模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"376":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-46","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#运行时的差异","content":"方面","locale":"zh-CN"},"377":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-47","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#运行时的差异","content":"pi-free","locale":"zh-CN"},"378":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-48","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#运行时的差异","content":"Hoshimi","locale":"zh-CN"},"379":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-49","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#运行时的差异","content":"失败后换什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"380":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-50","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#运行时的差异","content":"模型选择器换一个模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"381":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-51","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#运行时的差异","content":"同一个模型换一个账号；模型由调用方决定","locale":"zh-CN"},"382":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-52","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#运行时的差异","content":"状态码分类","locale":"zh-CN"},"383":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-53","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#运行时的差异","content":"可恢复 / 不可恢复的状态码表","locale":"zh-CN"},"384":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-54","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#运行时的差异","content":"同一张表，用来决定是否换账号","locale":"zh-CN"},"385":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-55","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#运行时的差异","content":"模型失效记录","locale":"zh-CN"},"386":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-56","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#运行时的差异","content":"10 分钟窗口，3 次后拉黑","locale":"zh-CN"},"387":{"id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free-57","page_id":"/docs/advanced-pi-free","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-pi-free#运行时的差异","content":"同样的 10 分钟和 3 次；只在内存中，重启或 `POST /api/v1/models/unavailable/reset` 清除","locale":"zh-CN"},"388":{"id":"/doc