"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#事件流","content":"`POST /conversations/{id}/stop` 停止回复：正在运行的工具被要求停止，等待中的批准被取消，回复连同已生成的内容保存为 `stopped`。所有跟随它的流都以这个 `done` 结束。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1559":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-308","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#后台进行的回复","content":"回复（以及压缩，`POST .../compact`）在服务端进行，与是否有客户端读取无关；一个对话同一时间只能有一个：已有回复进行时，发送、重试或压缩都会返回 `409`。对话的 `running` 表示有回复正在进行，`waiting` 表示它在等待批准；列表中的每个对话也会给出这两项。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1560":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-309","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#后台进行的回复","content":"`GET /conversations/{id}/events` 从第一个事件起推送正在进行的回复（`?after=n` 跳过前 `n` 个），与发送时推送的事件完全相同，之后实时推送后续事件，直到 `done`。可以有任意多个客户端同时跟随。没有回复进行时返回 `404`：回复已经结束，`GET /conversations/{id}` 中是保存后的结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1561":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-310","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#后台进行的回复","content":"在无人跟随时完成的回复，会像 `POST .../title` 那样为尚无标题的对话命名。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1562":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-311","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#重试","content":"`POST /conversations/{id}/messages/{message_id}/retry` 流式生成另一条回复，事件与发送相同，只是没有 `user`。`message_id` 可以是一条回复（新回复与它并列），也可以是一个还没有回复的问题（为它生成第一条回复）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1563":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-312","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#重试","content":"字段","locale":"zh-CN"},"1564":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-313","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#重试","content":"默认值","locale":"zh-CN"},"1565":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-314","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#重试","content":"`model`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1566":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-315","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#重试","content":"被重试回复的模型；对问题则为对话的模型","lo