审查用时。审查无法判断、调用转交给用户时，`failed` 为 `true`，`outcome` 为空，`rationale` 说明原因。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1619":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-368","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#步骤","content":"运行中被停止的调用还会带有 `\"cancelled\": true`。对话再次发给模型时，每一轮会还原为：该轮的补充消息、一条带 `tool_calls` 的 assistant 消息，以及每次调用对应的 `tool` 消息；没有开启工具时，调用及其结果以文字形式发送。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1620":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-369","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#批准","content":"`status` 为 `waiting` 的 `tool` 事件需要答复。用该步骤的 `id` 发送：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1621":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-370","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#批准","content":"`decision`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1622":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-371","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#批准","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"1623":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-372","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#批准","content":"`allow`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1624":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-373","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#批准","content":"运行这次调用","locale":"zh-CN"},"1625":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-374","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#批准","content":"`always`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1626":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-375","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#批准","content":"运行它，并在服务重启前，此对话中同一工具开关的调用不再询问（工作区内和工作区外分开计算）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1627":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-376","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#批准","content":"`deny`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1628":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-377","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#批准","content":"跳过它；模型会被告知用户拒绝了","locale":"zh-CN"},"1629":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-378","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#批准","content":"只有 `waiting` 状态的调用接受答复；`reviewing` 状态的调用由审查模型决定。成功返回 `204`；没有等待中的对应调用时返回 `404`。调用最多等待 10 分钟，之后视为拒绝。随后流中会发送该调用的下一个状态。哪些调用需要等待取决于审批模式（见 Playground 工具）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1630":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-379","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#补充说明","content":"`POST /conversations/{id}/steer`，请求体 `{\"content\": \"...\"}`，向正在进行的回复发送消息而不停止它。返回 `202` 和 `{\"id\": \"steer_…\"}`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1631":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-380","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#补充说明","content":"模型在下一轮开始时（当前调用完成后）读取它；随后流中发送一个 `steer` 事件，其步骤带有这个 `id`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1632":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-381","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#补充说明","content":"在模型收尾时发送的消息会让回复再继续一轮来回应它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1633":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-382","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#补充说明","content":"没有回复能接收时返回 `409`：没有回复在运行、运行中的回复没有工具，或回复刚刚结束。此时请把它作为新消息发送。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1634":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-383","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#补充说明","content":"消息为空时返回 `400`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1635":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-384","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#补充说明","content":"回复停止或失败时仍在排队的消息不会被读取。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1636":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-385","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#后台命令","content":"`GET /conversations/{id}/terminals` 列出该对话的工具启动的后台命令（`exec_command` 会话），包括仍在运行的，以及已退出但模型尚未读取其输出的：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1637":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-386","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#后台命令","content":"`DELETE /conversations/{id}/terminals/{session_id}` 停止其中一个