{"id":"/docs/cli-commands-58","page_id":"/docs/cli-commands","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-commands#serve","content":"`--ui`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1909":{"id":"/docs/cli-commands-59","page_id":"/docs/cli-commands","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-commands#serve","content":"在 API 旁边提供 Web UI；`--no-ui` 只提供 API","locale":"zh-CN"},"1910":{"id":"/docs/cli-commands-60","page_id":"/docs/cli-commands","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-commands#serve","content":"这些选项都只作用于本次启动，不会写入 `config.json`。`--access-token`、`--model-api-key`、`--default-model` 给空字符串时不起作用，沿用配置中的值。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1911":{"id":"/docs/cli-commands-61","page_id":"/docs/cli-commands","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-commands#serve","content":"`serve` 总是用这两个开关的值设置凭据续期和每日签到，而它们默认开启。因此即使 `config.json` 里写了 `server.auto_refresh: false` 或 `server.auto_checkin: false`（或在 **设置 › 自动化** 中关闭过），用 `hoshimi serve` 启动后它们仍然是开启的。要在启动时保持关闭，加上 `--no-refresh` 或 `--no-checkin`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1912":{"id":"/docs/cli-commands-62","page_id":"/docs/cli-commands","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-commands#serve","content":"启动过程：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1913":{"id":"/docs/cli-commands-63","page_id":"/docs/cli-commands","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-commands#serve","content":"读取配置，叠加上面的选项，按配置构建渠道。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1914":{"id":"/docs/cli-commands-64","page_id":"/docs/cli-commands","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-commands#serve","content":"地址不是本机回环地址（`127.*`、`localhost`、`::1`）时，打印警告。没有工具访问密钥时拒绝启动（退出码 4）；没有模型 API 密钥时警告外部模型接口不需要密钥即可调用。同时必须配置了 `security.allow_cidrs`，否则也拒绝启动（退出码 4）。见安全。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1915":{"id":"/docs/cli-commands-65","page_id":"/docs/cli-commands","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-commands#serve","content":"绑定端口。端口被占用时依次尝试下一个，直到 65535，再从 1024 绕回；换了端口会警告 `Port 10600 is unavailable. Using port 10601.`。`--strict-port` 下只尝试一个端口。找不到可用端口时以退出码 3 结束。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1916":{"id":"/docs/cli-commands-66","page_id":"/docs/cli-commands","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-commands#serve","content":"把地址写入数据目录的 `server.json`，在标准输出打印一行 `SERVER_READY url=<地址>`，并记录 `Hoshimi running on <地址>`。监听 `0.0.0.0` 或 `::` 时，打印的地址用 `127.0.0.1`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1917":{"id":"/docs/cli-commands-67","page_id":"/docs/cli-commands","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-commands#serve","content":"启用了 `--open` 时，稍后在浏览器中打开这个地址。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1918":{"id":"/docs/cli-commands-68","page_id":"/docs/cli-commands","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-commands#serve","content":"按 Ctrl+C 停止；退出时删除 `server.json`。没有构建好的 Web UI（源码安装而未构建）时，日志警告一句并只提供 API。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1919":{"id":"/docs/cli-commands-69","page_id":"/docs/cli-commands","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-commands#check","content":"检查配置并报告会提供哪些渠道和账户，不启动服务器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1920":{"id":"/docs/cli-commands-70","page_id":"/docs/cli-commands","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-commands#check","content":"选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"1921":{"id":"/docs/cli-commands-71","page_id":"/docs/cli-commands","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-commands#check","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"1922":{"id":"/docs/cli-commands-72","page_id":"/docs/cli-commands","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-commands#check","content":"`--json`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1923":{"id":"/docs/cli-commands-73","page_id":"/docs/cli-commands","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-commands#check","content":"打印 JSON","locale":"zh-CN"},"1924":{"id":"/docs/cli-commands-74","page_id":"/docs/cli-commands","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-commands#check","content":"检查的内容与 Web UI 保存设置时相同：网络策略和代理地址、端口范围、各项上限、Playground 设置，以及安全规则（例如监听非本机地址必须同时配置 `security.allow_cidrs` 和 `server.access_token`；`security.allow_origins` 需要 `server.access_token`）。有问题时以退出码 2 结束并说明原因。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1925":{"id":"/docs/cli-commands-75","page_id":"/docs/cli-commands","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-commands#check","content":"每个渠道写作 `<id>:<账户数>`，不需要账户的渠道在没有账户时标为 `(keyless)`。一个渠道都没有启用时打印一行错误，退出码为 2。","