ients#需要准备的三样东西","content":"密钥","locale":"zh-CN"},"2398":{"id":"/docs/clients-19","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#需要准备的三样东西","content":"网关的 **模型 API 密钥**；没有设置时任意非空字符串都行","locale":"zh-CN"},"2399":{"id":"/docs/clients-20","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#需要准备的三样东西","content":"**设置** › **访问** › **密钥**","locale":"zh-CN"},"2400":{"id":"/docs/clients-21","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#需要准备的三样东西","content":"模型名","locale":"zh-CN"},"2401":{"id":"/docs/clients-22","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#需要准备的三样东西","content":"`GET /v1/models` 返回的 `id`，或 `渠道/模型`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2402":{"id":"/docs/clients-23","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#需要准备的三样东西","content":"**模型** 页，或下文的 curl 命令","locale":"zh-CN"},"2403":{"id":"/docs/clients-24","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#需要准备的三样东西","content":"10600 端口被占用时，服务器会改用下一个空闲端口，以启动时终端打印的地址为准；**设置** › **访问** 中的 **监听地址** 显示实际使用的端口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2404":{"id":"/docs/clients-25","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#密钥","content":"Hoshimi 有两把互相独立的密钥，客户端只用其中一把：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2405":{"id":"/docs/clients-26","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#密钥","content":"密钥","locale":"zh-CN"},"2406":{"id":"/docs/clients-27","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#密钥","content":"配置键","locale":"zh-CN"},"2407":{"id":"/docs/clients-28","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#密钥","content":"用于","locale":"zh-CN"},"2408":{"id":"/docs/clients-29","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#密钥","content":"怎么发送","locale":"zh-CN"},"2409":{"id":"/docs/clients-30","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#密钥","content":"模型 API 密钥","locale":"zh-CN"},"2410":{"