gs":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#密钥","content":"密钥的设置方法、局域网访问和来源限制见访问控制。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2422":{"id":"/docs/clients-43","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#模型名","content":"先列出可用的模型：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2423":{"id":"/docs/clients-44","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#模型名","content":"`id` 是上游自己的模型名，`owned_by` 是提供它的渠道。请求里的 `model` 有两种写法：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2424":{"id":"/docs/clients-45","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#模型名","content":"**直接写 `id`**，如 `big-pickle`。Hoshimi 按渠道顺序找第一个提供这个模型的渠道。只启用了一个渠道时，目录里没有的模型名也会原样发给它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2425":{"id":"/docs/clients-46","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#模型名","content":"**写成 `渠道/模型`**，如 `opencode/big-pickle`，指定由哪个渠道处理。第一个斜杠后面的全部内容作为上游模型名发送，可以再含斜杠，例如 `kilo/kilo-auto/free`。几个渠道提供同名模型时，用这种写法选择其中一个。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2426":{"id":"/docs/clients-47","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#模型名","content":"请求不写 `model` 时，Chat Completions 和 Responses 使用 **设置** › **常规** 中的 **默认模型**（配置键 `server.default_model`，或 `hoshimi serve --default-model`）。Messages 接口始终要求写明 `model`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2427":{"id":"/docs/clients-48","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#模型名","content":"每个模型能否看图、是否推理、能否调用工具、有哪些推理强度，在 **模型** 页可以看到，见模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2428":{"id":"/docs/clients-49","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#选择哪种-api","content":"API","locale":"zh-CN"},"2429":{"id":"/docs/clients-50","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#选择哪种-api","content":"路径","locale":"zh-CN"},"2430":{"id":"/docs/clients-51","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#选择哪种-api","content":"适合","locale":"zh-CN"},"2431":{"id":"/docs/clients-52","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#选择哪种-api","content":"Chat Completions","locale":"zh-CN"},"2432":{"id":"/docs/clients-53","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#选择哪种-api","content":"`POST /v1/chat/completions`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2433":{"id":"/docs/clients-54","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#选择哪种-api","content":"绝大多数 OpenAI 兼容客户端、OpenAI SDK、OpenCode","locale":"zh-CN"},"2434":{"id":"/docs/clients-55","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#选择哪种-api","content":"Responses","locale":"zh-CN"},"2435":{"id":"/docs/clients-56","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#选择哪种-api","content":"`POST /v1/responses`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2436":{"id":"/docs/clients-57","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#选择哪种-api","content":"只说 Responses 的客户端，如 Codex","locale":"zh-CN"},"2437":{"id":"/docs/clients-58","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#选择哪种-api","content":"Messages","locale":"zh-CN"},"2438":{"id":"/docs/clients-59","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#选择哪种-api","content":"`POST /v1/messages`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2439":{"id":"/docs/clients-60","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#选择哪种-api","content":"Anthropic SDK、Claude Code","locale":"zh-CN"},"2440":{"id":"/docs/clients-61","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#选择哪种-api","content":"三种 API 共用同一个模型目录，任何模型都可以从任何一种 API 调用：Hoshimi 在客户端协议和上游协议之间转换。能转换不等于上游支持一切功能，例如不支持工具调用的模型，从哪种 API 调用都不会调用工具。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2441":{"id":"/docs/clients-62","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#流式输出","content":"Chat Completions 和 Responses 在请求中没有 `stream` 字段时按 **流式**（SSE）返回，这和 OpenAI 官方接口相反。要一次拿到完整 JSON，请显式发送 `\"stream\": false`。OpenAI 的 Python 和 JavaScript SDK 在不传 `stream` 时不会发送这个字段，结果拿到的是一段 SSE 文本而不是对象，所以非流式调用一定要写 `stream=False`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2442":{"id":"/docs/clients-63","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#流式输出","content":"Messages 与 Anthropic 一致：默认返回 JSON，`\"stream\": true` 时返回 SSE。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2443":{"id":"/docs/clients-64","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#无状态","content":"Hoshimi 不保存对话。每次请求都要带上完整的历史：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2444":{"id":"/docs/clients-65","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#无状态","content":"Chat Completions 和 Messages 发送全部 `messages`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2445":{"id":"/docs/clients-66","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#无状态","content":"Responses 发送全部 `input`；`previous_response_id` 会被拒绝（`400`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2446":{"id":"/docs/clients-67","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#无状态","content":"Playground 的对话保存在服务器上，但那是网页界面自己的接口，见 Playground API。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2447":{"id":"/docs/clients-68","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#推理强度","content":"三种 API 各有自己的字段，Hoshimi 都能读懂：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2448":{"id":"/docs/clients-69","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#推理强度","content":"API","locale":"zh-CN"},"2449":{"id":"/docs/clients-70","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#推理强度","content":"字段","locale":"zh-CN"},"2450":{"id":"/docs/clients-71","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#推理强度","content":"示例","locale":"zh-CN"},"2451":{"id":"/docs/clients-72","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#推理强度","content":"Chat Completions","locale":"zh-CN"},"2452":{"id":"/docs/clients-73","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#推理强度","content":"`reasoning_effort`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2453":{"id":"/docs/clients-74","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#推理强度","content":"`\"reasoning_effort\": \"high\"`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2454":{"id":"/docs/clients-75","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#推理强度","content":"Responses","locale":"zh-CN"},"2455":{"id":"/docs/clients-76","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#推理强度","content":"`reasoning.effort`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2456":{"id":"/docs/clients-77","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#推理强度","content":"`\"reasoning\": {\"effort\": \"low\"}`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2457":{"id":"/docs/clients-78","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#推理强度","content":"Messages","locale":"zh-CN"},"2458":{"id":"/docs/clients-79","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#推理强度","content":"`output_config.effort` 或 `thinking`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2459":{"id":"/docs/clients-80","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#推理强度","content":"`\"output_config\": {\"effort\": \"medium\"}`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2460":{"id":"/docs/clients-81","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#推理强度","content":"不同模型的推理选项不同。自带推理菜单的模型（例如 `disabled` / `low` / `high` / `max`）直接使用对应的级别；其余推理模型使用 Hoshimi 的三档输出预算 `light` / `balanced` / `deep`，OpenAI 的 `minimal`、`low`、`medium`、`high` 等会被映射过去。请求里不写推理强度时，Hoshimi 不改动请求。映射规则见 OpenAI 兼容接口，三档预算的含义见模型与账号行为。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2461":{"id":"/docs/clients-82","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#工具调用","content":"工具由客户端执行，Hoshimi 只负责在协议之间转换工具定义、调用和结果：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2462":{"id":"/docs/clients-83","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#工具调用","content":"Chat Completions：`tools` 中的 `function` 工具，回复里的 `tool_calls`，结果用 `role: \"tool\"` 消息发回。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2463":{"id":"/docs/clients-84","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#工具调用","content":"Responses：`type: \"function\"` 的工具，回复里的 `function_call` 项，结果用 `function_call_output` 项发回。其他类型的工具会被忽略。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2464":{"id":"/docs/clients-85","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#工具调用","content":"Messages：带 `input_schema` 的工具，回复里的 `tool_use` 块，结果用 `tool_result` 块发回。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2465":{"id":"/docs/clients-86","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#工具调用","content":"具体示例见各客户端页面。模型是否真的会调用工具取决于上游，**模型** 页的能力标记可供参考。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2466":{"id":"/docs/clients-87","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#从其他机器或容器连接","content":"默认只监听 `127.0.0.1`，而且只接受 `Host` 为 `localhost`、`127.0.0.1` 或 `::1` 的请求，所以从另一台机器或容器里访问（例如通过 `host.docker.internal`）会被拒绝。网页里运行的客户端还会受到来源检查。需要时按访问控制设置监听地址、**允许的 CIDR**、**允许的主机名** 和 **允许的来源**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2467":{"id":"/docs/clients-88","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#客户端指南","content":"<Card title=\"OpenAI SDK 与 curl\" href=\"/docs/clients-openai\" description=\"Python、JavaScript 和 curl：Chat Completions 与 Responses，流式、推理和工具调用。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2468":{"id":"/docs/clients-89","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#客户端指南","content":"<Card title=\"Anthropic SDK\" href=\"/docs/clients-anthropic\" description=\"用 Anthropic SDK 调用 Messages：流式、工具、思考和 Token 计数。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2469":{"id":"/docs/clients-90","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#客户端指南","content":"<Card title=\"Claude Code\" href=\"/docs/clients-claude-code\" description=\"ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL 等环境变量、模型别名和已知限制。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2470":{"id":"/docs/clients-91","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#客户端指南","content":"<Card title=\"Codex\" href=\"/docs/clients-codex\" description=\"在 config.toml 中添加 Hoshimi 作为模型提供方。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2471":{"id":"/docs/clients-92","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#客户端指南","content":"<Card title=\"OpenCode\" href=\"/docs/clients-opencode\" description=\"在 opencode.json 中添加 OpenAI 兼容的提供方。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2472":{"id":"/docs/clients-93","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#客户端指南","content":"<Card title=\"API 参考\" href=\"/docs/api\" description=\"认证、错误格式和每个接口的字段。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2473":{"id":"/docs/config-network","page_id":"/docs/config-network","type":"page","content":"网络与代理","breadcrumbs":["Hoshimi 文档","配置"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/config-network","locale":"zh-CN"},"2474":{"id":"/docs/config-network-0","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network","content":"Hoshimi 访问上游站点时走哪条线路：自动读取环境代理、直连或指定代理，按渠道覆盖，哪些请求受影响，以及如何读网络诊断。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2475":{"id":"/docs/config-network-1","page_id":"/docs/config-network","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/config-network#三种模式","content":"三种模式","locale":"zh-CN"},"2476":{"id":"/docs/config-network-2","page_id":"/docs/config-network","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/config-network#设置全局策略","content":"设置全局策略","locale":"zh-CN"},"2477":{"id":"/docs/config-network-3","page_id":"/docs/config-network","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/config-network#环境变量auto-模式","content":"环境变量（auto 模式）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2478":{"id":"/docs/config-network-4","page_id":"/docs/config-network","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/config-network#windows-系统代理","content":"Windows 系统代理","locale":"zh-CN"},"2479":{"id":"/docs/config-network-5","page_id":"/docs/config-network","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/config-network#按渠道覆盖","content":"按渠道覆盖","locale":"zh-CN"},"2480":{"id":"/docs/config-network-6","page_id":"/docs/config-network","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/config-network#哪些请求受影响","content":"哪些请求受影响","locale":"zh-CN"},"2481":{"id":"/docs/config-network-7","page_id":"/docs/config-network","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/config-network#修改何时生效","content":"修改何时生效","locale":"zh-CN"},"2482":{"id":"/docs/config-network-8","page_id":"/docs/config-network","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/config-network#网络诊断","content":"网络诊断","locale":"zh-CN"},"2483":{"id":"/docs/config-network-9","page_id":"/docs/config-network","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/config-network#渠道并发与等待","content":"渠道并发与等待","locale":"zh-CN"},"2484":{"id":"/docs/config-network-10","page_id":"/docs/config-network","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/config-network#共享范围与业务码","content":"共享范围与业务码","locale":"zh-CN"},"2485":{"id":"/docs/config-network-11","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network","content":"Hoshimi 向上游发出的请求（拉取模型目录、推理、登录、刷新令牌、查余额、签到）都按一条网络策略选择线路：直连，或经过某个代理。全局有一条默认策略，每个渠道可以单独覆盖。本页说明这些策略怎么写、怎么生效，以及出问题时去哪里看。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2486":{"id":"/docs/config-network-12","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network","content":"浏览器里打开的登录页面不受这些设置影响，它们使用浏览器自己的网络配置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2487":{"id":"/docs/config-network-13","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#三种模式","content":"模式","locale":"zh-CN"},"2488":{"id":"/docs/config-network-14","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#三种模式","content":"行为","locale":"zh-CN"},"2489":{"id":"/docs/config-network-15","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#三种模式","content":"`auto`（默认）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2490":{"id":"/docs/config-network-16","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#三种模式","content":"读取环境变量 `HTTPS_PROXY`、`HTTP_PROXY`、`ALL_PROXY` 和 `NO_PROXY` 决定是否走代理；都没有设置时直连","locale":"zh-CN"},"2491":{"id":"/docs/config-network-17","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#三种模式","content":"`direct`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2492":{"id":"/docs/config-network-18","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#三种模式","content":"始终直连，忽略环境变量","locale":"zh-CN"},"2493":{"id":"/docs/config-network-19","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#三种模式","content":"`proxy`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2494":{"id":"/docs/config-network-20","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#三种模式","content":"始终经过 `proxy` 中的代理","locale":"zh-CN"},"2495":{"id":"/docs/config-network-21","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#三种模式","content":"`inherit`（仅渠道）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2496":{"id":"/docs/config-network-22","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#三种模式","content":"使用全局策略，这是渠道的默认值","locale":"zh-CN"},"2497":{"id":"/docs/config-network-23","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#三种模式","content":"两条规则不受模式影响：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2498":{"id":"/docs/config-network-24","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#三种模式","content":"目标是本机（`localhost`、`*.localhost`、`127.0.0.0/8`、`::1`）的请求始终直连，所以本地模型服务不会被发到代理上。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2499":{"id":"/docs/config-network-25","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#三种模式","content":"配置了代理却连不上时，请求直接失败，**不会**退回直连。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2500":{"id":"/docs/config-network-26","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#设置全局策略","content":"在网页界面的 **设置** › **网络** 中选择 **自动（环境代理）**、**直连** 或 **指定代理**，填写 **代理地址** 后保存。也可以写在 `config.json` 里：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2501":{"id":"/docs/config-network-27","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#设置全局策略","content":"用命令行时，把整个对象一次写入（单独写 `network.mode proxy` 会因缺少代理地址被拒绝），然后重启服务器：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2502":{"id":"/docs/config-network-28","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#设置全局策略","content":"代理地址的要求：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2503":{"id":"/docs/config-network-29","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#设置全局策略","content":"协议是 `http`、`https`、`socks5` 或 `socks5h`；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2504":{"id":"/docs/config-network-30","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#设置全局策略","content":"有主机名，不带路径、查询参数或片段（结尾的 `/` 可以）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2505":{"id":"/docs/config-network-31","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#设置全局策略","content":"可以包含用户名和密码，如 `http://user:pass@proxy.example.com:8080`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2506":{"id":"/docs/config-network-32","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#设置全局策略","content":"代理地址可能含有密码。它明文保存在本地的 `config.json` 中；设置接口只返回“是否已配置”，`hoshimi config show` 显示为 `***`，网页上显示 **已配置代理，保存可替换。** 在网页上清空代理地址并保存，会回到自动模式（渠道则回到继承）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2507":{"id":"/docs/config-network-33","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#环境变量auto-模式","content":"`auto` 模式按目标地址的协议选择代理：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2508":{"id":"/docs/config-network-34","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#环境变量auto-模式","content":"`https://` 目标用 `HTTPS_PROXY`，`http://` 目标用 `HTTP_PROXY`；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2509":{"id":"/docs/config-network-35","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#环境变量auto-模式","content":"对应的变量为空时用 `ALL_PROXY`；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2510":{"id":"/docs/config-network-36","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#环境变量auto-模式","content":"目标命中 `NO_PROXY` 时直连。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2511":{"id":"/docs/config-network-37","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#环境变量auto-模式","content":"每个变量都是小写形式优先（`https_proxy` 优先于 `HTTPS_PROXY`）。环境变量里的代理地址同样会被校验，写错时请求会报错，而不是被悄悄忽略。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2512":{"id":"/docs/config-network-38","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#环境变量auto-模式","content":"`NO_PROXY` 用逗号（或分号）分隔，每一项可以是：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2513":{"id":"/docs/config-network-39","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#环境变量auto-模式","content":"写法","locale":"zh-CN"},"2514":{"id":"/docs/config-network-40","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#环境变量auto-模式","content":"匹配","locale":"zh-CN"},"2515":{"id":"/docs/config-network-41","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#环境变量auto-模式","content":"`example.com`、`.example.com`、`*.example.com`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2516":{"id":"/docs/config-network-42","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#环境变量auto-模式","content":"这个域名及其所有子域名","locale":"zh-CN"},"2517":{"id":"/docs/config-network-43","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#环境变量auto-模式","content":"`example.com:8443`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2518":{"id":"/docs/config-network-44","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#环境变量auto-模式","content":"这个域名的指定端口","locale":"zh-CN"},"2519":{"id":"/docs/config-network-45","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#环境变量auto-模式","content":"`10.0.0.0/8`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2520":{"id":"/docs/config-network-46","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#环境变量auto-模式","content":"落在这个网段里的 IP 地址目标","locale":"zh-CN"},"2521":{"id":"/docs/config-network-47","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#环境变量auto-模式","content":"`*`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2522":{"id":"/docs/config-network-48","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#环境变量auto-模式","content":"所有目标","locale":"zh-CN"},"2523":{"id":"/docs/config-network-49","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#环境变量auto-模式","content":"`<local>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2524":{"id":"/docs/config-network-50","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#环境变量auto-模式","content":"不含点的主机名","locale":"zh-CN"},"2525":{"id":"/docs/config-network-51","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#环境变量auto-模式","content":"`NO_PROXY` 只影响自动选择；`proxy` 模式下明确配置的代理不看它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2526":{"id":"/docs/config-network-52","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#windows-系统代理","content":"`network.system_proxy` 设为 `true`（网页上的 **无环境代理时使用 Windows 系统代理**）后，在 Windows 上，`auto` 模式没有找到环境变量代理时会读取系统代理设置（包括其中的例外列表）。其他系统上这个选项没有作用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2527":{"id":"/docs/config-network-53","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#按渠道覆盖","content":"每个渠道可以有自己的线路。在 **渠道** 页打开一个渠道，在它的 **网络** 部分选择线路；选 **继承全局配置** 就跟随 **设置** › **网络**。对应的配置是 `providers.<id>.options.network`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2528":{"id":"/docs/config-network-54","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#按渠道覆盖","content":"渠道没有写 `network`，或写了 `{\"mode\": \"inherit\"}`，就使用全局策略。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2529":{"id":"/docs/config-network-55","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#按渠道覆盖","content":"渠道写了明确的策略，就**整体替换**全局策略，不会与之合并。例如渠道写 `{\"mode\": \"auto\"}`，它会读环境变量，即使全局是 `proxy`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2530":{"id":"/docs/config-network-56","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#按渠道覆盖","content":"渠道的 `network` 对象里省略 `mode` 时等同于 `inherit`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2531":{"id":"/docs/config-network-57","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#哪些请求受影响","content":"请求","locale":"zh-CN"},"2532":{"id":"/docs/config-network-58","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#哪些请求受影响","content":"使用的策略","locale":"zh-CN"},"2533":{"id":"/docs/config