:[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#网络诊断","content":"记录里只有操作、主机、线路来源、时间、状态码和出错类别，不含请求路径、查询参数、请求头、请求体、Cookie 或代理地址。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2554":{"id":"/docs/config-network-80","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#网络诊断","content":"`operation` 的取值：`catalog`（模型目录）、`inference`（推理请求）、`token_refresh`（令牌刷新）、`token_exchange`（令牌交换）、`auth_start`（发起授权）、`auth_poll`（授权轮询）、`balance`（余额查询）、`checkin`（签到）、`request`（其他请求）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2555":{"id":"/docs/config-network-81","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#网络诊断","content":"`route` 的取值：`direct`（直连）、`configured_proxy`（配置的代理）、`environment_proxy`（环境变量代理）、`system_proxy`（Windows 系统代理）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2556":{"id":"/docs/config-network-82","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#网络诊断","content":"`kind` 的取值和含义：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2557":{"id":"/docs/config-network-83","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#网络诊断","content":"`kind`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2558":{"id":"/docs/config-network-84","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#网络诊断","content":"界面显示","locale":"zh-CN"},"2559":{"id":"/docs/config-network-85","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#网络诊断","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"2560":{"id":"/docs/config-network-86","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#网络诊断","content":"`ok`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2561":{"id":"/docs/config-network-87","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#网络诊断","content":"成功","locale":"zh-CN"},"2562":{"id":"/docs/config-network-88","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#网络诊断","content":"请求成功","locale":"zh-CN"},"2563":{"id":"/docs/config-network-89","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"ty