t-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#services","content":"Playground 工具的后台命令与审批","locale":"zh-CN"},"3186":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-80","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#services","content":"`build_services(settings=None)` 在没有传入设置时读取数据目录里的 `config.json`，然后：从配置收集每个渠道的账号和选项（`pool_inputs`），用它们构建 `Registry`；在数据目录打开 `hoshimi.db`，各个存储共用这个连接；最后创建续期、签到、登录和更新检查的服务。登录管理器在一次浏览器登录写入新账号后，立即用新配置重建渠道池。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3187":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-81","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#services","content":"直接构造的 `Services`（测试、嵌入）只需要 `settings` 和 `registry`，其余存储默认把数据放在内存里，定时器类服务为 `None`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3188":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-82","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#运行中更新配置","content":"在 Web UI 保存设置会调用 `Services.apply_settings(new)`，不需要重启：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3189":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-83","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#运行中更新配置","content":"只有**构建渠道池的输入**（每个渠道的账号、选项和禁用状态）变化时才重建池；只改端口之类的设置不会重建。重建时，配置没有变化的渠道原样保留，所以它们在内存里的状态（哪个账号的刷新令牌被拒绝、哪个账号正在冷却）不会丢；只有网络选项变化的渠道也保留，只更新路由。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3190":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-84","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#运行中更新配置","content":"持有设置对象的每个服务（续期、签到、登录、更新检查、网络客户端）都改为指向新设置，免得某个服务稍后把旧配置写回文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3191":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-85","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#运行中更新配置","content":"`server.check_updates` 的开关立即启停更新检查的定时器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3192":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-86","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#运行中更新配置","content":"`Services.close()` 依次停止各个定时器、关闭 Playground 的后台命令和渠道的 HTTP 客户端，写入最后一批用量记录，然后关闭数据库。重复调用是安全的。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3193":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-87","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#应用工厂","content":"`hoshimi/api/app.py` 的 `create_app(services, ...)` 构建 FastAPI 应用：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3194":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-88","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#应用工厂","content":"参数","locale":"zh-CN"},"3195":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-89","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#应用工厂","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"3196":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-90","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#应用工厂","content":"`services`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3197":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-91","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#应用工厂","content":"应用的全部服务，放在 `app.state.services`；路由通过依赖 `ServicesDep` 取得","locale":"zh-CN"},"3198":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-92","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#应用工厂","content":"`bound_host`、`bound_port`、`requested_port`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3199":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-93","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#应用工厂","content":"实际绑定的地址与请求的端口，设置页据此显示“端口被占用而换了一个”或“需要重启”","locale":"zh-CN"},"3200":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-94","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#应用工厂","content":"`extra_hosts`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3201":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-95","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture",