thropic Messages）。几条规则：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3414":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-133","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#归一化分片协议","content":"`finish.reason` 不是 `stop`、`tool_calls`、`length` 时按 `stop` 处理；上游没有发出 `finish` 时，输出端补一个 `stop`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3415":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-134","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#归一化分片协议","content":"`error` 分片在流式输出中变成一个错误帧；非流式时变成 `UpstreamStreamFailure`，再作为 `upstream_error`（502）返回。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3416":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-135","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#归一化分片协议","content":"只要已经产出过分片，渠道池就不再换账号重试，否则客户端会收到重复的内容。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3417":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-136","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#归一化分片协议","content":"OpenAI 兼容的站点不必自己解析流：`providers/openai_compat.py` 的 `consume_openai_sse(lines, provider=...)` 把 OpenAI 风格的 SSE 转成上面的分片；`read_body` 还能处理对流式请求返回整个 JSON 的上游。其他协议的转换在 `core/translate/`（`anthropic.py`、`gemini.py`、`solo.py`、`responses.py`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3418":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-137","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#错误与账号轮换","content":"适配器用 `ProviderError` 的子类报告上游的拒绝，渠道池按类型决定下一步：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3419":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-138","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#错误与账号轮换","content":"异常","locale":"zh-CN"},"3420":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-139","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#错误与账号轮换","content":"代码","locale":"zh-CN"},"3421":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-140","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#错误与账号轮换","conten