elopment-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#错误与账号轮换","content":"`PolicyBlocked`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3432":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-151","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#错误与账号轮换","content":"`policy_blocked`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3433":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-152","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#错误与账号轮换","content":"账号冷却 `policy_block_seconds`，不续期；换下一个账号","locale":"zh-CN"},"3434":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-153","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#错误与账号轮换","content":"`ModelSaturated`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3435":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-154","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#错误与账号轮换","content":"`model_saturated`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3436":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-155","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#错误与账号轮换","content":"模型本身过载，对每个账号都一样：立即停止，把站点的原话交给调用方","locale":"zh-CN"},"3437":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-156","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#错误与账号轮换","content":"`ModelGone`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3438":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-157","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#错误与账号轮换","content":"`model_gone`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3439":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-158","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#错误与账号轮换","content":"继续问其他账号；所有账号都这么说时，注册表把这个模型记为失效","locale":"zh-CN"},"3440":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-159","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#错误与账号轮换","content":"其他 `ProviderError`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3441":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-160","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#错误与账号轮换","content":"`upstream_error`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3442":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-161","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#错误与账号轮换","content":"状态码可恢复时换账号，否则（调用方自己请求的问题）立即停止","locale":"zh-CN"},"3443":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-162","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#错误与账号轮换","content":"所有账号都试过、而最后一个错误是“过一会儿可能就好”的那种时，渠道池最多再做 `backoff_retries` 轮：等待上游给出的时间（最多 `backoff_max_seconds`），没有给出时随机等待（full jitter）。一旦已经产出过内容，就不再重试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3444":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-163","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#错误与账号轮换","content":"`openai_compat.py` 的 `raise_for_status(response, provider=...)` 按固定顺序把一个 HTTP 回答归类：先看是否是“模型不存在”（404/410 等），再依次判断模型过载、安全拦截、401/403 认证失败、403 权限不足、额度（402/429 或正文里的额度字样）。顺序很重要：过载的模型常以普通的 429 出现，安全拦截常以普通的 403 出现，只看状态码就会把它们误判为额度用尽或凭据错误。流中以 200 返回的错误帧，只有“模型不存在”“过载”“拦截”“额度”几类会变成异常，其余作为 `error` 分片交给调用方。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3445":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-164","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#错误与账号轮换","content":"失效模型记录（`failure.py` 的 `DeadModelStore`）只在内存中：一次记录在 10 分钟后被遗忘；同一窗口内被记三次，记录就不再随时间解除。这个模型再次成功产出第一个分片时，记录被清除。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3446":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-165","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#错误与账号轮换","content":"`stream_using` 的 `on_route(provider_id, account_id, attempt)` 回调在某个账号产出第一个分片时触发，用量统计据此记录真正回答的账号。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3447":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-166","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#模型目录与能力","content":"`Provider.models()` 管理目录缓存，适配器只实现 `fetch_models()`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3448":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-167","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#模型目录与能力","content":"成功的目录缓存 300 秒。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3449":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-168","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#模型目录与能力","content":"取目录失败时保留上一次的结果，30 秒后再试；从来没有成功过时使用 `fallback_models()`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3450":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-169","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#模型目录与能力","content":"新目录不到上一次的一半时，视为不完整的回答，保留旧目录一个周期；下一个周期还是这样，才接受它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3451":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-170","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#模型目录与能力","content":"`fetch_models()` 成功取到目录时设置 `catalog_authoritative = True`（`OpenAiCompatProvider` 已经这样做），这样站点返回的空目录被当作真实答案，而不是回退到固定列表。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3452":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-171","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#模型目录与能力","content":"`specs()` 返回每个模型的 `ModelSpec`（`hoshimi/core/catalog.py`），它是推理强度策略和 `GET /api/v1/models` 读取的东西：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3453":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-172","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#模型目录与能力","content":"字段","locale":"zh-CN"},"3454":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-173","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#模型目录与能力","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"3455":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-174","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#模型目录与能力","content":"`wire`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3456":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-175","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#模型目录与能力","content":"发给上游时用的协议：`chat`、`messages`、`responses` 等","locale":"zh-CN"},"3457":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-176","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#模型目录与能力","content":"`vision`、`reasoning`、`tools`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3458":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-177","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#模型目录与能力","content":"是否接受图片、是否会思考、是否支持工具（`tools` 为 `None` 表示未知）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3459":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-178","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#模型目录与能力","content":"`context_window`、`max_output`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3460":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-179","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#模型目录与能力","content":"上下文与输出上限，未知时为 131072 与 32768","locale":"zh-CN"},"3461":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-180","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#模型目录与能力","content":"`free`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3462":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-181","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#模型目录与能力","content":"调用是否免费；三态，`None` 表示站点没有说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"3463":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-182","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#模型目录与能力","content":"`efforts`、`effort_default`、`effort_off_id`、`effort_patch`、`effort_off_patch`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3464":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-183","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#模型目录与能力","content":"模型自己的推理强度选项及其在线路上的写法","locale":"zh-CN"},"3465":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-184","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#模型目录与能力","content":"`can_disable_thinking`、`region_sensitive`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3466":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-185","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#模型目录与能力","content":"能否关闭思考、是否与地区有关","locale":"zh-CN"},"3467":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-186","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#模型目录与能力","content":"各站点的能力表放在 `catalog.py`（`zhipu_spec`、`kilo_spec`、`cline_spec` 等）。默认的 `specs()` 给每个模型一个惰性的规格（不推理，所以推理强度策略不改动请求体），再从 models.dev 补充“是否推理”和“是否接受图片”这两项；能力表已经写明的不会被覆盖。推理强度的行为见模型行为。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3468":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-187","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#写一个专用适配器","content":"以智谱 GLM 渠道（`providers/zhipu.py`）为例，它是一个 OpenAI 兼容站点：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3469":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-188","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#写适配器类","content":"OpenAI 兼容的站点继承 `OpenAiCompatProvider`，只声明地址、目录路径和固定列表，并按需覆盖请求头、请求体或目录解析：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3470":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-189","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#写适配器类","content":"`OpenAiCompatProvider.stream_raw` 已经完成了其余的事：构造请求体（`build_body`，强制 `stream: true`）、记录上游的额度响应头、对错误调用 `raise_for_status`、用 `consume_openai_sse` 转换流。协议不是 OpenAI 的站点直接继承 `Provider`，自己实现 `stream_raw`，借助 `core/translate/` 里的转换函数。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3471":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-190","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#注册","content":"在 `providers/factory.py` 中把类加入 `PROVIDER_CLASSES`，并把 ID 放进 `PROVIDER_ORDER` 的合适位置。这个顺序决定不带前缀的模型名先在哪个渠道里查找，也是匿名渠道的启动顺序。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3472":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-191","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#写能力表","content":"在 `catalog.py` 中为这个站点写一个 `<id>_spec(model_id, provider)`，填入上下文、图片、思考和推理强度选项。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3473":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-192","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#描述账号表单","content":"在 `core/provider_forms.py` 的 `credential_forms()` 中说明添加账号时要填哪些字段（例如 `zhipu` 只需 `api_key`）。Web UI 的 **添加账号** 对话框和管理 API 都读取它；只列出适配器真正接受的字段。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3474":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-193","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#写测试","content":"用 `httpx.MockTransport` 代替上游，检查请求发到了哪里、带了什么，以及产出的分片：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3475":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-194","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#写测试","content":"测试的布局与共享夹具见测试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3476":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-195","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#更新文档","content":"在免费站点或对应的渠道页面写明怎样登录、提供什么、有哪些限制，中英文都要写；渠道来自某个参考项目时，在 `core/provider_sources.py` 记录它，再运行 `python scripts/generate_provider_inventory.py` 重新生成渠道来源清单。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3477":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-196","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#添加一个按数据定义的服务","content":"只需 API 密钥、协议常规的服务不必写类：在 `core/provider_definitions.py` 的 `CANONICAL_PROVIDERS` 中加一行即可，例如：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3478":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-197","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#添加一个按数据定义的服务","content":"字段","locale":"zh-CN"},"3479":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-198","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#添加一个按数据定义的服务","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"3480":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-199","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#添加一个按数据定义的服务","content":"`id`、`name`、`base