9","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#添加一个按数据定义的服务","content":"`adapter`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3491":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-210","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#添加一个按数据定义的服务","content":"`configured`（自动生成类）、`dedicated`（有专用适配器）、`local`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3492":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-211","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#添加一个按数据定义的服务","content":"`implemented`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3493":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-212","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#添加一个按数据定义的服务","content":"是否已经实现；未实现的不会注册","locale":"zh-CN"},"3494":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-213","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#添加一个按数据定义的服务","content":"`key_env`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3495":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-214","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#添加一个按数据定义的服务","content":"参考项目读取密钥的环境变量名，仅作记录，Hoshimi 不读取它","locale":"zh-CN"},"3496":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-215","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#添加一个按数据定义的服务","content":"`configured` 的服务由 `regular_provider_classes()` 生成一个 `ConfiguredProvider` 子类；`provider_forms.py` 自动为支持 `api_key` 的服务提供“API 密钥 + 地址 + 模型”的表单。目录接口特殊的服务在 `providers/catalog_profiles.py` 描述，请求体需要调整的在 `providers/request_profiles.py` 描述。`tests/core/test_provider_definitions.py` 检查同一品牌的不同服务不会因为名字或地址相同而合并。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3497":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-216","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#交互式登录","content":"需要浏览器登录或设备码的站点，在 `core/login/` 里写一个登录流程。命令行的 `hoshimi login <id>` 和 Web UI 的登录对话框共用它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3498":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-217","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#契约","content":"流程拿到一个 HTTP 客户端和一个报告函数 `report`。站点一给出浏览器地址，流程就必须调用 `report(url)`：命令行打印它并打开浏览器，API 把它交给 Web UI，两者都不必知道站点用的是设备码、外部登录链接还是本地回调端口。然后流程阻塞，直到凭据就绪，返回渠道认识的账号字典；失败时抛出 `LoginError`，消息会直接显示给用户。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3499":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-218","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#契约","content":"`report` 是一个 `LoginReporter`，还提供：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3500":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-219","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#契约","content":"方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"3501":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-220","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#契约","content":"用途","locale":"zh-CN"},"3502":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-221","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#契约","content":"`report.device_code(url, code, expires_in)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3503":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-222","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#契约","content":"设备码流程：报告地址、用户要输入的代码和有效期","locale":"zh-CN"},"3504":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-223","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#契约","content":"`report.authorization(server, timeout)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3505":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-224","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#契约","content":"等待本地回调，同时允许用户粘贴最终的回调 URL 或授权码","locale":"zh-CN"},"3506":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-225","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#契约","content":"`report.wait(seconds)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3507":{"id"