ent":"每次登录是一个会话（`pending`、`succeeded`、`failed`），在后台线程中运行，开始一小时后被清理；会话可以取消，等待授权码的会话可以提交授权码。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3516":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-235","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#注册与写回","content":"成功后，凭据写入 `config.json` 中该渠道的 `accounts`，并启用这个渠道。凭据里带有稳定身份（`user_id`、`account_id`、`userid`、`uid`、`sub`、`access_key_id`、`api_key`、`access_token` 中的第一个）时，同一身份再次登录会替换原账号，而不是新增一个。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3517":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-236","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#注册与写回","content":"写入之后渠道池立即按新配置重建，新账号马上可用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3518":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-237","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#注册与写回","content":"需要续期的凭据，在适配器中实现 `refresh_account`。`refresh.py` 的定时器每 30 分钟检查一次所有账号，在记录的过期时间前一小时内（没有记录过期时间的账号每次都）续期，并只把变化的那个账号写回 `config.json`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3519":{"id":"/docs/development-release","page_id":"/docs/development-release","type":"page","content":"CI 与发布","breadcrumbs":["Hoshimi 文档","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-release","locale":"zh-CN"},"3520":{"id":"/docs/development-release-0","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release","content":"版本号放在哪里、wheel 怎样带上 Web UI 构建并检查、CI 的四个工作流各做什么、一次推送怎样把新版本发布到 PyPI 和 GitHub，以及文档站怎样部署。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3521":{"id":"/docs/development-release-1","page_id":"/docs/development-release","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-release#版本号","content":"版本号","locale":"zh-CN"},"3522":{"id":"/docs/development-release-2","page_id":"/docs/development-release","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-release#构建发行包scriptsbuild_wheelpy","content":"构建发行包：`scripts/build_wheel.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3523":{"id":"/docs/development-release-3","page_id":"/docs/development-release","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-release#