的测试**：Playground 的 shell 与后台命令测试在 Windows 上跳过（`pytest.mark.skipif(os.name == \"nt\", ...)`）；需要切换本地时区的用量测试在没有 `time.tzset` 的平台上跳过。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3909":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-73","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#常用写法","content":"**自己的 Services**：需要特定设置时调用 `make_services(default_model=..., ...)`；需要多个渠道时传入额外的 `FakeProvider` 或子类。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3910":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-74","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#web-ui-测试","content":"在 `hoshimi/webui` 中，`bun run test` 运行 Vitest，`bun run typecheck` 运行 vue-tsc；`python scripts/dev.py test-web` 依次运行两者。测试环境是 happy-dom，`src/test/setup.ts` 补上 `@material/web` 需要的 `ElementInternals`，`src/test/motion-zero.css` 把所有动效时长设为 0，测试永远不必等待过渡。Vitest 用 `vmThreads` 池运行（Windows 上工作线程会争抢创建临时目录）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3911":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-75","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#web-ui-测试","content":"测试和被测文件放在一起（`*.test.ts`）。除了组件、仓库和查询的测试，有几组测试检查的是全局规则：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3912":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-76","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#web-ui-测试","content":"测试","locale":"zh-CN"},"3913":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-77","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#web-ui-测试","content":"规则","locale":"zh-CN"},"3914":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-78","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#web-ui-测试","content":"`src/layout.test.ts`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3915":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-79","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#web-ui-测试","content":"布局规则：可收缩的行、有界的列表、只通过 `.app-scroll` 滚动、滚动条通道、底部导航、图表不被拉伸，见 Web UI","locale":"zh-CN"},"3916":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-80","page_id":"/