`、生成的 `schema.d.ts`、`types.ts`、`queries/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4034":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-67","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#源码布局","content":"`src/stores/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4035":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-68","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#源码布局","content":"`auth`（访问密钥）、`preferences`（主题、语言、动效）、`live`（实时调用）、`chat`（Playground）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4036":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-69","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#源码布局","content":"`src/i18n/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4037":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-70","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#源码布局","content":"`en.ts`、`zh-CN.ts`、`ja.ts` 与 `index.ts`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4038":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-71","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#源码布局","content":"`src/theme/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4039":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-72","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#源码布局","content":"`scheme.ts`、`applyTheme.ts`、`tokens.css`、`scrollbars.ts`、`breakpoints.ts`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4040":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-73","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#源码布局","content":"`src/test/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4041":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-74","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#源码布局","content":"测试环境：`setup.ts`（为 happy-dom 补上 `ElementInternals`）、`motion-zero.css`（所有动效时长为 0）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4042":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-75","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#源码布局","content":"模块之间一律用 `@/` 别名导入（`@/` 指向 `src/`），不写相对路径。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4043":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-76","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#部署根路径与路由","content":"界面不编译进任何 API 地址：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4044":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-77","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#部署根路径与路由","content":"Vite 的 `base` 是 `./`，资源用相对路径，同一份构建可以放在根路径，也可以放在反向代理的子路径下。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4045":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-78","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#部署根路径与路由","content":"`src/api/baseUrl.ts` 从当前脚本的 URL 推导部署根：脚本在 `<根>/assets/` 下，取 `/assets/` 之前的部分。所以服务器使用 `api_prefix` 或位于反向代理之后时，界面无需改动。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4046":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-79","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#部署根路径与路由","content":"路由使用 hash 模式（`#/overview`），不需要服务器做任何重写。`/channels/:id` 把选中的渠道放进地址，刷新或返回手势都能回到原处。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4047":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-80","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#与服务器的契约生成的类型","content":"界面的 TypeScript 类型来自服务器的 OpenAPI 文档。改了管理 API 的请求或响应模型后，重新生成并提交：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4048":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-81","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#与服务器的契约生成的类型","content":"它把 `scripts/generate_openapi.py` 的输出写进临时的 `hoshimi/webui/openapi.json`，运行 `bun x openapi-typescript` 生成 `src/api/schema.d.ts`，再删掉临时文件。手动做同一件事：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4049":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-82","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#与服务器的契约生成的类型","content":"`generate_openapi.py` 用空设置和一个临时数据目录构建应用，所以生成的文档只描述数据的形状，与本机的配置无关。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4050":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-83","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#与服务器的契约生成的类型","content":"`openapi.json` 被 `.gitignore` 排除；`schema.d.ts` 要提交。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4051":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-84","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#与服务器的契约生成的类型","content":"`python scripts/dev.py typegen-check` 重新生成后运行 `git diff --exit-code`，CI 用它在类型过期时失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4052":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-85","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#与服务器的契约生成的类型","content":"代码通过 `src/api/types.ts` 的别名使用这些类型（`S['SettingsView']` 等），通过 `client.ts` 导出的 `api`（openapi-fetch）发请求，并用 `unwrap()` 把失败变成带服务器消息的 `ApiError`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4053":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-86","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#数据请求","content":"**认证**：`api` 的中间件给每个请求加上 `Authorization: Bearer <访问密钥>`。密钥保存在浏览器的 `localStorage`（`hoshimi:access-token`）；服务器以 `auth_required` 回答 401 时，界面弹出输入访问密钥的对话框。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4054":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-87","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#数据请求","content":"**查询**：`src/api/queries/` 按领域封装 Vue Query，查询键集中在 `queries/keys.ts`，层级结构，使某个前缀失效就使其下所有键失效。4xx 的 `ApiError` 不重试，其他失败最多重试 2 次；窗口获得焦点时不自动重新请求。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4055":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-88","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#数据请求","content":"**实时数据**：`stores/live.ts` 维持唯一一条到 `GET /api/v1/stats/live` 的连接，它驱动顶栏的实时调用面板、**用量** 页面和 **概览** 页面的卡片。连接用 `fetch` 读取（`api/sse.ts`），因为 `EventSource` 不能在请求头里带访问密钥。REST 仍是事实来源：一次调用结束会使用量和渠道的查询失效并重新请求；断线后以 1、2、4、8、15、30 秒的间隔重连，并从新的快照开始。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4056":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-89","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#i18n","content":"界面文字放在 `src/i18n/` 的三个文件里：`en.ts` 是来源，`zh-CN.ts` 和 `ja.ts` 是翻译。组件里这样用：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4057":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-90","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#i18n","content":"`t(key, params)` 先找当前语言，找不到时用英文，再找不到时返回键本身；`{name}` 形式的占位符由 `params` 替换。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4058":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-91","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#i18n","content":"语言偏好默认为 `auto`，跟随浏览器的首选语言（`zh*` 为简体中文，`ja*` 为日文，其他为英文），并在系统语言变化时更新。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4059":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-92","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#i18n","content":"`src/i18n/i18n.test.ts` 要求三个文件的键完全相同、每条消息的占位符也相同。加一条文字就要在三个文件里都加上。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4060":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-93","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#主题与设计令牌","content":"**颜色**：所有颜色角色由一个种子色生成（`theme/scheme.ts`，默认 `#5267d8`，用户可以换），使用 Material 的 Tonal Spot 方案，有标准、中、高三档对比度。`theme/applyTheme.ts` 把它们写成 `:root` 上的 `--md-sys-color-*`，并跟随系统的明暗设置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4061":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-94","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#主题与设计令牌","content":"**静态令牌**：字体、形状、高度、动效时长与缓动、状态层等在 `theme/tokens.css`，变量名为 `--md-sys-*` 和 `--app-*`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4062":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-95","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#主题与设计令牌","content":"**规则**：组件只用令牌，不写字面量颜色、圆角或时长。`src/tokens.test.ts` 检查 `src/theme/` 之外的 `.vue` 和 `.css` 文件里没有十六进制颜色。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4063":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-96","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#主题与设计令牌","content":"**图表**：数据系列按固定顺序使用 `--app-chart-1` 到 `--app-chart-8` 这八个经过色盲校验的颜色槽；图表带图例和悬停 / 聚焦提示。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4064":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-97","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#组件图层与动效","content":"**共享组件**：页面和组合组件从 `@/ui` 取用共享组件，不重新设定它们的样式（`ui/index.ts` 的约定）。页面的骨架是一行 `Toolbar`，下面是一列 `PageSection`；页面按内容区的宽度调整布局（`@container app-content`）。可能无限增长的列表放在 `ScrollArea` 或 `DataTable` 里（`DataTable` 可排序，超过 200 行时只渲染可见部分）。渠道页面是 `ListDetail` 布局。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4065":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-98","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#组件图层与动效","content":"**选择**：从少数几项中选一项（列表筛选、报表范围）用 `SegmentedControl`，放不下时变成下拉选择；日期用 `DatePicker`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4066":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-99","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#组件图层与动效","content":"**回复**：`ui/Markdown.vue` 按块渲染回复（流式输出时只有正在写的块会变，已画好的图表或上方打开的预览不受影响）。模型文本不可信：原始 HTML 保持为文字；数学公式交给不带 `trust` 的 KaTeX；Mermaid 以 `strict` 模式绘制，首次用到时加载（`ui/mermaid.ts`），并按源码和主题缓存；`html` 代码块只在请求时预览，放在 `sandbox=\"allow-scripts\"` 且 CSP 禁止联网的 `iframe` 中；其他网站上的媒体要等用户点击，除非浏览器偏好设置为始终加载（`ui/markdownRich.ts`）。任何标记了 `data-view` 的元素都通过 `useImageViewer` 在 `ImageViewer` 中打开。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4067":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-100","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#组件图层与动效","content":"**图层**：浮在页面上的东西（对话框、侧边面板、菜单、打开的选择器）都通过 `ui/layers.ts` 叠放：后打开的画在上面；Esc 和点击外部只关闭最上层；模态层打开时，页面和它下面的层都设为 `inert`；层关闭后把焦点还给打开它的元素。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4068":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-101","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#组件图层与动效","content":"**动效**：页面之间用 View Transitions 淡入淡出；标签页和筛选沿共享的水平轴滑动（`AxisPanes`）；列表-详情的详情区在条目之间纵向移动（`shared-axis-y`）；一个视图替换另一个时淡入淡出（`FadeSwap`），Playground 中一个对话替换另一个时也是如此；切换 Playground 中某条消息的版本时，该消息及其后的内容沿水平轴滑动（`components/chat/VersionPanes.vue`，基于 `AxisPanes`），上方的内容保持不动；一排控件中出现和消失的控件（输入框里的推理强度和审批芯片、上下文圆环）连同旁边的间距一起展开和收起宽度（`chip-row`、`chipRowHooks`），其他控件随之滑动，较长的模型名称逐渐收窄而不是跳变；文字变化的芯片平滑过渡到新宽度（`useMorphWidth`）；列表项使用 `list` 动效。**设置 › 外观 › 动画**（或系统的“减少动态效果”）把所有过渡换成简短的淡入淡出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4069":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-102","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#布局规则","content":"`src/layout.test.ts` 把下面这些规则写成测试，违反任何一条 `bun run test` 就失败：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4070":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-103","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#布局规则","content":"规则","locale":"zh-CN"},"4071":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-104","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#布局规则","content":"原因","locale":"zh-CN"},"4072":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-105","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#布局规则","content":"把名字和控件放在同一行的行，其文字元素有 `min-width: 0`（测试列出了具体的组件和选择器）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4073":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-106","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#布局规则","content":"模型 ID 常常是一个很长、不能断开的词，没有它，按钮会被挤出视野","locale":"zh-CN"},"4074":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-107","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#布局规则","content":"模型和用量页面的列表用 `DataTable`，渠道详情的账号列表用 `ScrollArea`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4075":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-108","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#布局规则","content":"可能无限增长的列表在自身内部滚动，不把页面拉成无尽的一列","locale":"zh-CN"},"4076":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-109","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#布局规则","content":"任何组件的样式里都不写会滚动的 `overflow: auto` / `scroll`，也不写 `scrollbar-width`、`scrollbar-color`、`scrollbar-gutter`（只有 `ui/NavigationRail.vue` 例外，它有意隐藏滚动条）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4077":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-110","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#布局规则","content":"每个滚动区域都通过 `.app-scroll` 滚动，见下文","locale":"zh-CN"},"4078":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-111","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#布局规则","content":"`.app-scroll` 纵向滚动、横向裁剪；`.app-scroll.app-scroll-x` 横向滚动、纵向不滚动，纵向滑动交给外层","locale":"zh-CN"},"4079":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-112","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#布局规则","content":"一个区域只朝一个方向滚动","locale":"zh-CN"},"4080":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-113","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#布局规则","content":"Markdown 的代码块、表格、独立公式和图表，以及 `Stepper`，自己横向滚动（`app-scroll app-scroll-x`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4081":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-114","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#布局规则","content":"有意比所在列更宽的内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"4082":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-115","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#布局规则","content":"`tokens.css` 里没有作用于 `.app-scroll` 子元素的规则","locale":"zh-CN"},"4083":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-116","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#布局规则","content":"这类规则会覆盖组件自己的外边距，使页面、菜单项、Playground 的对话列一个接一个地溢出","locale":"zh-CN"},"4084":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-117","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#布局规则","content":"`ui/` 里的组件不在根元素上声明 `transition`（`AppCard`、`StackedBarChart` 例外）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4085":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-118","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#布局规则","content":"切换面板时由动效系统移动根元素，自己的 `transition` 会覆盖它","locale":"zh-CN"},"4086":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-119","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#布局规则","content":"每个页面的根元素、`AppDialog` 与 `SideSheet` 的 `.body`、`DataTable` 的 `.row`，其 `padding-inline-end` 用到 `var(--app-scroll-lane)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4087":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-120","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#布局规则","content":"滚动条的通道只在末端一侧，末端的内边距要减去它，内容两侧才对称","locale":"zh-CN"},"4088":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-121","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#布局规则","content":"Playground 路由带 `meta: { fill: true }`，外壳此时不保留滚动条通道，它的 `.thread` 用负的 `margin-inline-end` 伸进内边距；`ListDetail` 的详情区同理","locale":"zh-CN"},"4089":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-122","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#布局规则","content":"占满整个框架的页面在自身内部滚动","locale":"zh-CN"},"4090":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-123","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#布局规则","content":"底部导航栏的目的地 `min-width: 0`，指示器 `max-width: 64px` 而不是固定 `width: 64px`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4091":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-124","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#布局规则","content":"六个 64px 的目的地比小屏手机还宽","locale":"zh-CN"},"4092":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-125","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#布局规则","content":"带 `viewBox` 的 SVG 不使用 `preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4093":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-126","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#布局规则","content":"图表按自己的尺寸绘制，被拉伸的图会把圆点变成椭圆","locale":"zh-CN"},"4094":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-127","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#app-scroll","content":"`theme/tokens.css` 中的 `.app-scroll` 让滚动条拥有自己的通道，位于内容旁边而不是覆盖在内容上：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4095":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-128","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#app-scroll","content":"Chromium 和 WebKit 使用带样式的滚动条，即使系统使用浮动滚动条（macOS、Windows 11、GTK），它也占据布局空间。设置了 `scrollbar-width` 或 `scrollbar-color` 后这些引擎会忽略 `::-webkit-scrollbar`，所以任何地方都不设置它们。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4096":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-129","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#app-scroll","content":"Firefox 使用细滚动条和主题颜色；Firefox 的滚动条浮动时，`theme/scrollbars.ts` 的 `applyScrollbars()` 把 `data-scrollbars` 设为 `overlay`，通道宽度设为 0。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4097":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-130","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#app-scroll","content":"没有溢出时也保留滚动条的位置（`scrollbar-gutter: stable`），滚动条出现时内容不会移动；菜单和选择器用 `app-scroll-auto` 放弃这个位置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4098":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-131","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#app-scroll","content":"`--app-scroll-lane` 是通道实际占用的宽度（启动时测量）；`--app-scroll-head` 让纵向轨道从吸顶标题下方开始，`--app-scroll-inset` 让滑块避开圆角。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4099":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-132","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#app-scroll","content":"单元测试检查的是源码；真实浏览器中的横向溢出由 `scripts/check_layout.py` 检查，见测试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4100":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-133","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#写视图","content":"在 `src/views/` 加一个 `<名称>View.vue`。根元素的类要在 `padding-inline-end` 中减去 `var(--app-scroll-lane)`，页面由 `Toolbar` 和 `PageSection` 组成，组件从 `@/ui` 取用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4101":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-134","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#加路由与导航","content":"在 `src/router.ts` 加一条懒加载的路由；在 `src/App.vue` 的导航目的地中加一项，图标取自 `@/ui` 导出的 `icons`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4102":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-135","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#加文字","content":"在 `en.ts`、`zh-CN.ts`、`ja.ts` 中加上 `nav.<名称>` 和页面用到的所有键。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4103":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-136","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#检查","content":"运行 `python scripts/dev.py test-web`；把新页面的路径加入 `scripts/check_layout.py` 的 `PAGES`，在真实浏览器里检查一遍；页面用到新的 API 时先运行 `typegen`。最后在使用教程中为它写一页，中英文都要写。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4104":{"id":"/docs/development","page_id":"/docs/development","type":"page","content":"开发文档","breadcrumbs":["Hoshimi 文档","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development","locale":"zh-CN"},"4105":{"id":"/docs/development-0","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development","content":"面向贡献者的入口：Hoshimi 由哪几部分组成、以什么为准、全局约定，以及各开发页面分别讲什么。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4106":{"id":"/docs/development-1","page_id":"/docs/development","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development#以什么为准","content":"以什么为准","locale":"zh-CN"},"4107":{"id":"/docs/development-2","page_id":"/docs/development","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development#一个发行包四层","content":"一个发行包，四层","locale":"zh-CN"},"4108":{"id":"/docs/development-3","page_id":"/docs/development","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development#页面","content":"页面","locale":"zh-CN"},"4109":{"id":"/docs/development-4","page_id":"/docs/development","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development#几条贯穿全局的约定","content":"几条贯穿全局的约定","locale":"zh-CN"},"4110":{"id":"/docs/development-5","page_id":"/docs/development","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development#参考项目","content":"参考项目","locale":"zh-CN"},"4111":{"id":"/docs/development-6","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development","content":"这一部分写给想修改 Hoshimi 的人：修 bug、接入一个新渠道、给 Web UI 加一个页面、改一条 API，或者维护本文档站。它描述代码现在**是什么样**、遵守哪些规则以及为什么，而不是使用方法（使用方法见使用教程、命令行和 API 参考）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4112":{"id":"/docs/development-7","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#以什么为准","content":"**代码和测试**：其他任何内容与它们冲突时，以它们为准。很多规则本身就是测试（分层规则、Web UI 的布局与配色规则、i18n 键一致），破坏规则的改动过不了 CI。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4113":{"id":"/docs/development-8","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#以什么为准","content":"**本站**：本站取代了仓库原来的 `docs/` 目录，是 Hoshimi 唯一的文档。用户能看到的改动（命令、选项、配置键、端点、界面）要同时更新对应页面，中文和英文都要改，见文档站。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4114":{"id":"/docs/development-9","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#以什么为准","content":"**参考项目**：协议和行为的来源是几个外部仓库的本地克隆，它们被 `.gitignore` 排除，不是运行时依赖，见下文参考项目。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4115":{"id":"/docs/development-10","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#一个发行包四层","content":"Hoshimi 是一个 Python 发行包 `hoshimi`，Web UI 的构建产物（`hoshimi/webui/dist/`）随 wheel 一起发布。包内分四层：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4116":{"id":"/docs/development-11","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#一个发行包四层","content":"目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"4117":{"id":"/docs/development-12","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#一个发行包四层","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"4118":{"id":"/docs/development-13","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#一个发行包四层","content":"依赖的框架","locale":"zh-CN"},"4119":{"id":"/docs/development-14","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#一个发行包四层","content":"`hoshimi/core/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4120":{"id":"/docs/development-15","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#一个发行包四层","content":"全部逻辑：配置、凭据、渠道适配器、路由、协议转换、用量统计、登录流程、Playground 的工具","locale":"zh-CN"},"4121":{"id":"/docs/development-16","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#一个发行包四层","content":"不导入任何 Web 或命令行框架；只用 httpx 访问上游","locale":"zh-CN"},"4122":{"id":"/docs/development-17","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#一个发行包四层","content":"`hoshimi/api/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4123":{"id":"/docs/development-18","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#一个发行包四层","content":"FastAPI 应用：中间件、路由（`/v1` 模型 API 与 `/api/v1` 管理 API）、Web UI 静态文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"4124":{"id":"/docs/development-19","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#一个发行包四层","content":"FastAPI、Starlette","locale":"zh-CN"},"4125":{"id":"/docs/development-20","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#一个发行包四层","content":"`hoshimi/cli/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4126":{"id":"/docs/development-21","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#一个发行包四层","content":"Typer 命令：`serve`、`check`、`models`、`providers`、`stations`、`login`、`version`、`env`、`config`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4127":{"id":"/docs/development-22","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#一个发行包四层","content":"Typer、Rich","locale":"zh-CN"},"4128":{"id":"/docs/development-23","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#一个发行包四层","content":"`hoshimi/webui/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4129":{"id":"/docs/development-24","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#一个发行包四层","content":"Vue 3 + Vite 的界面；`dist/` 随包发布","locale":"zh-CN"},"4130":{"id":"/docs/development-25","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#一个发行包四层","content":"Bun 构建，不进入 Python 依赖","locale":"zh-CN"},"4131":{"id":"/docs/development-26","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#一个发行包四层","content":"API 和命令行都从同一个入口开始：`hoshimi.core.context.build_services()` 把所有服务构建一次，得到一个 `Services`。`core` 不知道自己被谁调用，`tests/core/test_architecture.py` 保证它不导入 FastAPI、Starlette、Typer、Click、Uvicorn、Rich，也不引用 `hoshimi.api` 或 `hoshimi.cli`。整体架构就从这条规则讲起。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4132":{"id":"/docs/development-27","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#页面","content":"<Card title=\"开发环境\" href=\"/docs/development-setup\" description=\"仓库布局、Python 环境、bun、scripts/dev.py 的全部任务，以及同时运行 API 和 Vite 的开发模式。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"4133":{"id":"/docs/development-28","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#页面","content":"<Card title=\"整体架构\" href=\"/docs/development-architecture\" description=\"core / api / cli / webui 的分层、Services 的组装、应用工厂、错误映射，以及一个请求的完整路径。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"4134":{"id":"/docs/development-29","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#页面","content":"<Card title=\"渠道适配器\" href=\"/docs/development-providers\" description=\"Provider 契约、归一化的流式分片协议、错误与账号轮换、模型目录与能力，以及登录流程。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"4135":{"id":"/docs/development-30","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#页面","content":"<Card title=\"Web UI\" href=\"/docs/development-webui\" description=\"Vue 应用的结构、由 OpenAPI 生成类型、i18n、主题与令牌、图层与动效，以及布局规则。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"4136":{"id":"/docs/development-31","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#页面","content":"<Card title=\"测试\" href=\"/docs/development-testing\" description=\"pytest 的布局与共享夹具、Vitest 规则测试、生成类型的检查，以及在真实浏览器里查横向溢出的 check_layout.py。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"4137":{"id":"/docs/development-32","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#页面","content":"<Card title=\"CI 与发布\" href=\"/docs/development-release\" description=\"CI 工作流、版本号、wheel 的构建与安装检查、发布到 PyPI 和 GitHub，以及文档站的部署。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"4138":{"id":"/docs/development-33","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#页面","content":"<Card title=\"文档站\" href=\"/docs/development-site\" description=\"本站的结构、怎样写页面、本地预览与构建、部署、统计与评论。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"4139":{"id":"/docs/development-34","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#几条贯穿全局的约定","content":"**Python**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4140":{"id":"/docs/development-35","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#几条贯穿全局的约定","content":"支持 Python 3.10 及以上；CI 在 Linux、Windows、macOS 上对 3.10–3.14 做类型检查，在 3.10、3.12、3.14 上运行测试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4141":{"id":"/docs/development-36","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#几条贯穿全局的约定","content":"Ruff 负责 lint 和格式化，行宽 180；只允许绝对导入（`ban-relative-imports = \"all\"`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4142":{"id":"/docs/development-37","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#几条贯穿全局的约定","content":"ty 做类型检查，以 Python 3.10 为目标版本，CI 中警告也算失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4143":{"id":"/docs/development-38","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#几条贯穿全局的约定","content":"`import hoshimi` 不加载 FastAPI 和 httpx：包的公开名字（`VERSION`、`Services`、`build_services`、`create_app`）是惰性导出的，`tests/test_package_api.py` 检查这一点。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4144":{"id":"/docs/development-39","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#几条贯穿全局的约定","content":"**Web UI**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4145":{"id":"/docs/development-40","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#几条贯穿全局的约定","content":"模块之间用 `@/` 别名导入，不写相对路径；`src/theme/` 之外不写十六进制颜色；每个可滚动区域都用 `.app-scroll`。这些都有测试，见 Web UI。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4146":{"id":"/docs/development-41","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#几条贯穿全局的约定","content":"界面文字有英文、简体中文和日文三份，键和占位符必须一致。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4147":{"id":"/docs/development-42","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#几条贯穿全局的约定","content":"**接口契约**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4148":{"id":"/docs/development-43","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#几条贯穿全局的约定","content":"Web UI 的 TypeScript 类型由服务器的 OpenAPI 文档生成（`src/api/schema.d.ts`），提交进仓库；CI 重新生成并在有差异时失败。改了管理 API 的模型，就要运行 `python scripts/dev.py typegen` 并提交结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4149":{"id":"/docs/development-44","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#几条贯穿全局的约定","content":"**文档**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4150":{"id":"/docs/development-45","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#几条贯穿全局的约定","content":"用户能看到的改动在同一次提交里更新本站页面，中英文都要改。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4151":{"id":"/docs/development-46","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#参考项目","content":"下面这些仓库作为本地克隆放在仓库根目录，用于对照协议和行为。它们都在 `.gitignore` 里，不进入本仓库，也不是 Hoshimi 的依赖：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4152":{"id":"/docs/development-47","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#参考项目","content":"克隆","locale":"zh-CN"},"4153":{"id":"/docs/development-48","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#参考项目","content":"用途","locale":"zh-CN"},"4154":{"id":"/docs/development-49","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#参考项目","content":"`codex-api`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4155":{"id":"/docs/development-50","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#参考项目","content":"服务器与安全方面的参考","locale":"zh-CN"},"4156":{"id":"/docs/development-51","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#参考项目","content":"`dsh-our-free-model`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4157":{"id":"/docs/development-52","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#参考项目","content":"免费站点的协议参考；捆绑的 EAC 中继封印移植自它（MIT）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4158":{"id":"/docs/development-53","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#参考项目","content":"`Hanaikada`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4159":{"id":"/docs/development-54","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#参考项目","content":"Hoshimi 采用的分层 Python + Vue 骨架，`scripts/dev.py` 也由它而来","locale":"zh-CN"},"4160":{"id":"/docs/development-55","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#参考项目","content":"`pi`、`pi-free`、`free-claude-code`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4161":{"id":"/docs/development-56","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#参考项目","content":"渠道定义的来源，渠道来源清单记录了它们的快照","locale":"zh-CN"},"4162":{"id":"/docs/development-57","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#参考项目","content":"没有这些克隆也能开发、测试和构建：测试不读取它们（`tests/core/test_provider_definitions.py` 明确不依赖参考仓库的检出）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4163":{"id":"/docs/first-run","page_id":"/docs/first-run","type":"page","content":"首次运行","breadcrumbs":["Hoshimi 文档","开始"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/first-run","locale":"zh-CN"},"4164":{"id":"/docs/first-run-0","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run","content":"第一次启动 Hoshimi 后会看到什么：数据目录里多了什么、界面的布局、设置了访问密钥时如何登录、默认启用的两个匿名渠道，以及每样东西在哪里。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4165":{"id":"/docs/first-run-1","page_id":"/docs/first-run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/first-run#启动时发生了什么","content":"启动时发生了什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"4166":{"id":"/docs/first-run-2","page_id":"/docs/first-run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/first-run#界面布局","content":"界面布局","locale":"zh-CN"},"4167":{"id":"/docs/first-run-3","page_id":"/docs/first-run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/first-run#登录设置了工具访问密钥时","content":"登录（设置了工具访问密钥时）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4168":{"id":"/docs/first-run-4","page_id":"/docs/first-run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/first-run#默认的两个匿名渠道","content":"默认的两个匿名渠道","locale":"zh-CN"},"4169":{"id":"/docs/first-run-5","page_id":"/docs/first-run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/first-run#各个页面","content":"各个页面","locale":"zh-CN"},"4170":{"id":"/docs/first-run-6","page_id":"/docs/first-run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/first-run#东西在哪里","content":"东西在哪里","locale":"zh-CN"},"4171":{"id":"/docs/first-run-7","page_id":"/docs/first-run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/first-run#接下来","content":"接下来","locale":"zh-CN"},"4172":{"id":"/docs/first-run-8","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run","content":"本页带你走一遍第一次启动之后的界面。还没有安装的话，先看快速开始。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4173":{"id":"/docs/first-run-9","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#启动时发生了什么","content":"**不需要配置文件。** 没有 `config.json` 时，Hoshimi 使用全部默认值：监听 `127.0.0.1:10600`，不设任何密钥，只启用两个匿名渠道。`config.json` 在你第一次保存设置、添加账户或执行 `hoshimi config set` 时才会创建。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4174":{"id":"/docs/first-run-10","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#启动时发生了什么","content":"**数据目录。** 服务器在数据目录里创建 `hoshimi.db`（用量、签到记录、探测结果和 Playground 对话）和 `server.json`（正在运行的服务器的地址和 PID）。数据目录的位置见数据目录，也显示在 **设置 › 关于** 中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4175":{"id":"/docs/first-run-11","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#启动时发生了什么","content":"**后台定时任务。** 凭据续期（每 30 分钟）和每日签到随服务器启动，日志里会各有一行。还会在后台向 PyPI 查询是否有新版本。这三项都可以关闭，见配置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4176":{"id":"/docs/first-run-12","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#启动时发生了什么","content":"**浏览器。** 大约一秒后浏览器打开 `http://127.0.0.1:10600`，地址随即变成 `http://127.0.0.1:10600/#/overview`。页面地址都在 `#` 之后，可以直接收藏，例如 `#/playground`、`#/settings?tab=access`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4177":{"id":"/docs/first-run-13","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#界面布局","content":"位置","locale":"zh-CN"},"4178":{"id":"/docs/first-run-14","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#界面布局","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"4179":{"id":"/docs/first-run-15","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#界面布局","content":"左侧导航栏","locale":"zh-CN"},"4180":{"id":"/docs/first-run-16","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#界面布局","content":"**概览**、**模型**、**渠道**、**用量**、**Playground**；**设置** 在导航栏底部。窗口较窄时导航栏变成底部的标签栏。有渠道需要处理时，**渠道** 上会显示数字角标","locale":"zh-CN"},"4181":{"id":"/docs/first-run-17","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#界面布局","content":"右上角","locale":"zh-CN"},"4182":{"id":"/docs/first-run-18","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#界面布局","content":"**实时活动** 按钮：显示正在进行的调用数，点开是今天的 Token、调用次数、缓存命中率，以及正在进行和刚刚完成的调用。旁边是主题按钮，在 **浅色**、**深色**、**跟随系统** 之间切换","locale":"zh-CN"},"4183":{"id":"/docs/first-run-19","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#界面布局","content":"界面语言默认跟随系统（支持英文、简体中文和日文），可以在 **设置 › 常规 › 语言** 中固定为某一种。主题、主题色、对比度和动画在 **设置 › 外观** 中调整。这些界面偏好只保存在当前浏览器里，不写入服务器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4184":{"id":"/docs/first-run-20","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#登录设置了工具访问密钥时","content":"默认没有任何密钥，打开就能用。**概览** 页 **接口** 一栏底部会写着 **尚未设置工具访问密钥。**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4185":{"id":"/docs/first-run-21","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#登录设置了工具访问密钥时","content":"设置了工具访问密钥（`server.access_token`）之后，浏览器第一次访问时会弹出 **请输入工具访问密钥** 对话框：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4186":{"id":"/docs/first-run-22","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#登录设置了工具访问密钥时","content":"在 **工具访问密钥** 中输入密钥。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4187":{"id":"/docs/first-run-23","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#登录设置了工具访问密钥时","content":"点 **登录**（或按 Enter）。密钥错误时提示 **工具访问密钥不正确。**，原来保存的密钥不受影响。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4188":{"id":"/docs/first-run-24","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#登录设置了工具访问密钥时","content":"验证通过后，密钥保存在这个浏览器的 localStorage 中，之后不再询问；换一个浏览器或设备需要重新登录。在 **设置 › 访问 › 密钥** 中修改或清除密钥后，当前浏览器自动更新，其他浏览器需要重新登录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4189":{"id":"/docs/first-run-25","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#登录设置了工具访问密钥时","content":"设置密钥的三种方式：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4190":{"id":"/docs/first-run-26","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#登录设置了工具访问密钥时","content":"或者在 **设置 › 访问 › 密钥 › 工具访问密钥** 中保存，立即生效。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4191":{"id":"/docs/first-run-27","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#登录设置了工具访问密钥时","content":"工具访问密钥保护 Web UI 和管理接口（`/api/v1/*`、`/docs`、`/openapi.json`）；模型接口 `/v1/*` 由另一把独立的 **模型 API 密钥** 保护。Playground 走的是管理接口，所以只需要工具访问密钥。两把密钥的区别和局域网访问见安全。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4192":{"id":"/docs/first-run-28","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text"