:"/docs/guide-overview#接口","content":"**模型列表**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4730":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-30","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#接口","content":"大多数 SDK 把 `http://127.0.0.1:10600/v1` 作为 base URL。例如：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4731":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-31","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#接口","content":"如果在 **设置 › 访问** 中设置了 **模型 API 密钥**，请求还要带上 `Authorization: Bearer <模型 API 密钥>`（或 `x-api-key`）。模型 id 可以在模型页复制。各种客户端的接法见接入客户端。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4732":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-32","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#接口","content":"列表下方的一行说明工具访问密钥的状态：**管理此服务需要工具访问密钥。** 或 **尚未设置工具访问密钥。**。没有设置工具访问密钥时，标题旁还有 **API 文档** 按钮，在新标签页中打开服务器自带的接口文档（`/docs`）。设置了密钥后这个按钮不显示，因为该页面无法携带浏览器中保存的密钥；此时可以用请求头访问 `/docs` 和 `/openapi.json`，见 API 参考。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4733":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-33","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#渠道","content":"这里列出已设置或已启用的渠道（只是可用但还没设置的站点留在渠道页）。每张卡片显示：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4734":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-34","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#渠道","content":"渠道名称和状态：**就绪**、**需要处理**、**已关闭**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4735":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-35","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#渠道","content":"账号数量，或者 **无需账户**（匿名渠道，如 OpenCode Zen 和 Kilo）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4736":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-36","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#渠道","content":"目录中来自该渠道的模型数（目录加载完成后显示）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4737":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-37","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#渠道","content":"今天用过时，显示今天的 Token 量。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4738":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-38","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#渠道","content":"点卡片直接打开该渠道的详情，点 **管理渠道** 打开渠道列表。模型目录正在加载或有提供商加载失败时，卡片上方会显示加载进度、失败的提供商及原因，以及 **重试** 按钮。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4739":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-39","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#渠道","content":"一个渠道都没有时显示 **没有启用任何提供商**。这时到 **渠道** 页登录一个免费站点或添加 API 密钥即可；不需要编辑文件，也不需要重启。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4740":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-40","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#服务器","content":"项目","locale":"zh-CN"},"4741":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-41","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#服务器","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"4742":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-42","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#服务器","content":"**版本**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4743":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-43","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#服务器","content":"正在运行的 Hoshimi 版本","locale":"zh-CN"},"4744":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-44","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#服务器","content":"**最新版本**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4745":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-45","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#服务器","content":"PyPI 上最新的正式版本，旁边标明 **有可用更新** 或 **已是最新**；还没查到时显示 **正在检查…**，从未查成功时显示 **无法检查**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4746":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-46","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#服务器","content":"**默认模型**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4747":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-47","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#服务器","content":"请求没有指定模型时使用的模型；没有设置时显示 **未设置**。在 **设置 › 常规** 中修改","locale":"zh-CN"},"4748":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-48","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#服务器","content":"服务器启动后在后台向 PyPI 查询一次，之后每天再查一次，只读取版本号，不会下载或安装任何东西。查询使用全局网络设置。不想让 Hos