pe":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#工具","content":"**自动审查**（`review`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5058":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-109","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#工具","content":"**自动审查**：由模型判断命令、文件更改以及工作区外的访问，拒绝有风险的操作，无法判断时询问你；**先询问**（`ask`）：运行命令、更改文件以及访问工作区外的内容前询问；**仅在工作区外询问**（`workspace`，旧名称 `auto`）：工作区内的命令和更改直接运行，读取或更改工作区外的文件时询问；**完全访问**（`full`）：从不询问。需要许可的调用由审查模型判断，或在对话中等待你批准；对话输入框中的盾牌按钮可以单独更改该对话的模式","locale":"zh-CN"},"5059":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-110","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#工具","content":"**审查模型**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5060":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-111","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#工具","content":"`playground.review_model`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5061":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-112","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#工具","content":"**对话自身使用的模型**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5062":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-113","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#工具","content":"在“自动审查”模式下判断工具调用。建议选择快速而谨慎的模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"5063":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-114","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#工具","content":"**Shell**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5064":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-115","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#工具","content":"`playground.shell`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5065":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-116","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#工具","content":"**自动**（`auto`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5066":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-117","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#工具","content":"模型未指定 shell 时命令在此运行。**自动** 使用 bash（没有 bash 时用 `sh`；Windows 上用 PowerShell，没有时用 `cmd`），说明文字显示当前实际使用的 shell（“当前为 bash”）。菜单只列出本机已安装的 shell；模型仍可要求使用其中