llation-23","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#安装","content":"`python -m hoshimi` 与 `hoshimi` 命令等价，在 `hoshimi` 不在 `PATH` 中时很有用。安装后可以先检查一下：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5424":{"id":"/docs/installation-24","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#可选依赖","content":"两个云平台需要额外的 SDK，按需安装对应的 extra：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5425":{"id":"/docs/installation-25","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#可选依赖","content":"Extra","locale":"zh-CN"},"5426":{"id":"/docs/installation-26","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#可选依赖","content":"安装的包","locale":"zh-CN"},"5427":{"id":"/docs/installation-27","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#可选依赖","content":"什么时候需要","locale":"zh-CN"},"5428":{"id":"/docs/installation-28","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#可选依赖","content":"`google`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5429":{"id":"/docs/installation-29","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#可选依赖","content":"`google-auth[requests]`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5430":{"id":"/docs/installation-30","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#可选依赖","content":"Vertex 使用应用默认凭据（ADC）或服务账户文件时；Vertex 的 API Key 模式不需要","locale":"zh-CN"},"5431":{"id":"/docs/installation-31","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#可选依赖","content":"`bedrock`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5432":{"id":"/docs/installation-32","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#可选依赖","content":"`boto3`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5433":{"id":"/docs/installation-33","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#可选依赖","content":"使用 Amazon Bedrock 时，包括 Bearer（API Key）模式：解析 Bedrock 的事件流也需要它","locale":"zh-CN"},"5434":{"id":"/docs/installation-34","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#可选依赖","content":"其他普通 HTTP API 渠道都不需要这些 SDK。账户的配置方法见云平台。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5435":{"id":"/docs/installation-35","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#升级","content":"升级后重启服务器。启用了更新检查（`server.check_updates`，默认开启）时，服务器在启动时和之后每天询问一次 PyPI 是否有新版本，结果显示在 **概览** 页 **服务器** 一栏的 **最新版本** 中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5436":{"id":"/docs/installation-36","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#升级","content":"配置和数据都在数据目录里，升级不会动它们。从较早的版本升级时注意两点，详见数据目录：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5437":{"id":"/docs/installation-37","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#升级","content":"`--config` 选项和 `HOSHIMI_CONFIG` 环境变量已经移除，工作目录下的配置文件既不会被读取，也不会被自动迁移。启动新版本之前，把旧文件移到 `hoshimi config path` 打印的位置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5438":{"id":"/docs/installation-38","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#升级","content":"首次启动时，旧的 `stats.json`、`checkin.json` 和 `probe.json` 会被导入数据库 `hoshimi.db`，原文件改名为 `*.migrated`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5439":{"id":"/docs/installation-39","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#从源码安装","content":"源码仓库里没有构建好的 Web UI。需要 Bun 构建一次：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5440":{"id":"/docs/installation-40","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#从源码安装","content":"没有构建 Web UI 时，服务器会在日志里警告一句，然后只提供 API。开发环境（带开发依赖、热重载的前端）见开发环境。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5441":{"id":"/docs/installation-41","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#端口与地址","content":"`hoshimi serve` 默认监听 `127.0.0.1:10600`，只有本机可以访问。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5442":{"id":"/docs/installation-42","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#端口与地址","content":"**端口被占用时**：服务器自己绑定套接字，所以测试过的端口就是实际使用的端口。请求的端口被占用或被系统保留时，它依次尝试下一个端口，直到 65535，然后从 1024 开始绕回到请求的端口之前；其他绑定错误（例如本机没有的地址）会立即失败。换用了别的端口时，日志会提示 `Port 10600 is unavailable. Using port 10601.`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5443":{"id":"/docs/installation-43","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#端口与地址","content":"**固定端口**：客户端需要固定地址时，用 `--strict-port`（或配置 `server.strict_port: true`），此时只尝试请求的端口，被占用就以退出码 3 结束。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5444":{"id":"/docs/installation-44","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#端口与地址","content":"**任意空闲端口**：`--port 0` 让系统挑选一个。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5445":{"id":"/docs/installation-45","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#端口与地址","content":"**实际地址在哪里**：终端打印的 `SERVER_READY url=…`；数据目录里的 `server.json`（主机、实际端口、URL 和进程 PID，服务器退出时删除）；以及 **设置 › 访问 › 监听地址** 中的 **正在监听 …**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5446":{"id":"/docs/installation-46","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#端口与地址","content":"在命令行里给出的 `--host`、`--port` 只作用于这一次启动；要长期修改，用 `hoshimi config set server.port 11000` 或在 **设置 › 访问** 中修改（重启后生效）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5447":{"id":"/docs/installation-47","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#端口与地址","content":"把 `--host` 设为 `0.0.0.0` 或局域网地址，任何能连到这台机器的人都可能借用你的上游账户。Hoshimi 要求先同时配置工具访问密钥（`server.access_token`）和允许的网段（`security.allow_cidrs`），否则拒绝启动。完整步骤见安全。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5448":{"id":"/docs/installation-48","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#在后台运行","content":"在服务器或无桌面的机器上，加 `--no-open` 不打开浏览器。用系统的服务管理器让它常驻，例如 Linux 上的 systemd 用户服务（`~/.config/systemd/user/hoshimi.service`）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5449":{"id":"/docs/installation-49","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#在后台运行","content":"把 `/path/to/hoshimi` 换成 `which hoshimi` 的输出，然后：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5450":{"id":"/docs/installation-50","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#在后台运行","content":"服务以哪个用户运行，就使用哪个用户的数据目录；要指定位置，在 `[Service]` 中加 `Environment=HOSHIMI_DATA_DIR=/srv/hoshimi`（见环境变量）。`GET /health` 不需要密钥，返回 `{\"status\":\"ok\"}`，可以用来做存活检查：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5451":{"id":"/docs/installation-51","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#卸载","content":"卸载不会删除数据目录。其中有配置文件（包括各渠道的凭据）、用量数据库和 Playground 对话；不再需要时手动删除：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5452":{"id":"/docs/installation-52","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#卸载","content":"平台","locale":"zh-CN"},"5453":{"id":"/docs/installation-53","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#卸载","content":"默认数据目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"5454":{"id":"/docs/installation-54","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#卸载","content":"Linux","locale":"zh-CN"},"5455":{"id":"/docs/installation-55","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#卸载","content":"`~/.local/share/hoshimi`，设置了 `XDG_DATA_HOME` 时为 `$XDG_DATA_HOME/hoshimi`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5456":{"id":"/docs/installation-56","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#卸载","content":"Windows","locale":"zh-CN"},"5457":{"id":"/docs/installation-57","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#卸载","content":"`%APPDATA%\\hoshimi`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5458":{"id":"/docs/installation-58","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#卸载","content":"macOS","locale":"zh-CN"},"5459":{"id":"/docs/installation-59","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#卸载","content":"`~/Library/Application Support/hoshimi`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5460":{"id":"/docs/installation-60","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#卸载","content":"设置了 `HOSHIMI_DATA_DIR` 时，数据目录就是它指向的位置。`hoshimi config path` 会打印配置文件的完整路径，它所在的文件夹就是数据目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5461":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","type":"page","content":"聚合入口 agg","breadcrumbs":["Hoshimi 文档","渠道"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/providers-agg","locale":"zh-CN"},"5462":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-0","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg","content":"用 agg 渠道接入任意 OpenAI 兼容站点：填写地址或选用 22 个站点预设、账号字段、多站点共存、模型能力声明和免费标记。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5463":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-1","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/providers-agg#添加账号","content":"添加账号","locale":"zh-CN"},"5464":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-2","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/providers-agg#账号字段","content":"账号字段","locale":"zh-CN"},"5465":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-3","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/providers-agg#站点预设","content":"站点预设","locale":"zh-CN"},"5466":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-4","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/providers-agg#同一渠道下的多个站点","content":"同一渠道下的多个站点","locale":"zh-CN"},"5467":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-5","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/providers-agg#能力声明","content":"能力声明","locale":"zh-CN"},"5468":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-6","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/providers-agg#免费标记","content":"免费标记","locale":"zh-CN"},"5469":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-7","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/providers-agg#站点特有的处理","content":"站点特有的处理","locale":"zh-CN"},"5470":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-8","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg","content":"`agg` 是通用的兼容入口：一个渠道下可以放很多站点，每个账号自带站点地址（`base_url`）和密钥。OpenRouter 的免费池、SiliconFlow、SambaNova 这类服务，只要讲 OpenAI Chat Completions，就是一条配置而不需要新代码。常用的 22 个站点已内置为预设，只填名字和密钥即可。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5471":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-9","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg","content":"如果服务在原生渠道列表中（例如 `openrouter`、`groq`、`deepseek`、`siliconflow`），优先用原生渠道，见本地与兼容端点。Cline、Kilo、Qoder、OpenCode 这类有原生登录和续期的站点不在预设中：用 agg 接它们会把可续期的凭据换成会过期的令牌。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5472":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-10","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#添加账号","content":"打开 **渠道** › **Aggregator**，点 **添加账号**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5473":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-11","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#添加账号","content":"在 **站点** 中搜索并选择一个预设；不在列表中的站点选 **自定义地址…**，在 **Base URL** 中填写它的 OpenAI 根地址（`/chat/completions` 和 `/models` 所在的那一级，通常以 `/v1` 结尾）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5474":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-12","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#添加账号","content":"填写 **API key**，**账号 ID（可选）** 留空则由网关命名，点 **保存账号**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5475":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-13","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#添加账号","content":"保存前会校验：缺地址、未知预设或缺密钥的账号不会被保存。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5476":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-14","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#添加账号","content":"编辑文件后重启服务。缺地址、未知预设或缺密钥的账号会在启动时告警（`agg: dropping accounts without base_url or key`）并被丢弃，其余账号照常工作。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5477":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-15","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#账号字段","content":"字段","locale":"zh-CN"},"5478":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-16","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#账号字段","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"5479":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-17","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#账号字段","content":"`id`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5480":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-18","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#账号字段","content":"账号名。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5481":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-19","page_id":"/docs/providers-a