rl":"/docs/providers-agg#站点预设","content":"预设只提供地址，不含模型列表；模型始终实时读取。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5596":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-134","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#同一渠道下的多个站点","content":"不同站点的同一个 ID 可能是不同的模型、不同的价格，因此网关记录每个 ID 来自哪个站点：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5597":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-135","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#同一渠道下的多个站点","content":"请求某个 ID 时，先尝试在 `models` 中声明了它的账号，再尝试没有声明 `models` 的账号，最后才是其余账号。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5598":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-136","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#同一渠道下的多个站点","content":"只有一个站点时不需要任何声明。站点多了以后，用 `models` 把 ID 固定到对应账号，可以避免请求先落到不认识该 ID 的站点上。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5599":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-137","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#同一渠道下的多个站点","content":"站点的规则（聊天模型筛选、免费标记、能力表）按 `base_url` 地址识别，而不是按 `preset` 名字：写着 `preset: sambanova` 却把 `base_url` 指向别处的账号，不会套用 SambaNova 的规则。自定义地址不套用任何站点规则。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5600":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-138","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#能力声明","content":"站点的 `/models` 通常只有 ID。没有声明时，agg 把模型当作不支持图片、不思考的普通模型，调用方的请求原样转发。需要时在 `options` 中声明：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5601":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-139","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#能力声明","content":"键","locale":"zh-CN"},"5602":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-140","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#能力声明","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"5603":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-141","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#能力声明","content":"`vision`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5604":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-142","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#能力声明","content":"是否接受图片输入。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5605":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-143","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#能力声明","content":"`reasoning`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5606":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-144","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#能力声明","content":"是否为思考模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5607":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-145","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#能力声明","content":"`context_window`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5608":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-146","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#能力声明","content":"上下文长度（token）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5609":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-147","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#能力声明","content":"`max_output`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5610":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-148","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#能力声明","content":"最大输出长度（token）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5611":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-149","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#能力声明","content":"`efforts`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5612":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-150","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#能力声明","content":"思考级别菜单，按显示顺序。包含 `disabled` 时可以关闭思考。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5613":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-151","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#能力声明","content":"`effort_default`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5614":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-152","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#能力声明","content":"默认级别。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5615":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-153","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#能力声明","content":"`effort_patch`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5616":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-154","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#能力声明","content":"选中某个级别时合并到请求体的 JSON，其中的 `\"$effort\"` 替换为级别名。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5617":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-155","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#能力声明","content":"`effort_off_patch`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5618":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-156","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#能力声明","content":"选中关闭级别时合并到请求体的 JSON。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5619":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-157","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#能力声明","content":"`region_sensitive`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5620":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-158","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#能力声明","content":"是否与网络出口地区相关。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5621":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-159","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#能力声明","content":"`model_specs`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5622":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-160","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#能力声明","content":"按模型 ID 覆盖以上各键。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5623":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-161","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#能力声明","content":"优先级：账号声明高于站点自己目录中的信息，站点信息高于默认值；平铺在 `options` 中的键作为默认值，`model_specs` 中该 ID 的值最后生效。平铺键会作用于整个渠道的所有 ID，渠道下有多个站点时，请把声明写在 `model_specs` 中。没有声明的 ID，只从 models.dev 补充“是否思考、是否接受图片”两项，不借用其他站点的上下文长度。也可以把同样的键写在 `providers.agg.options` 中作为整个渠道的默认值。能力与思考级别的完整规则见模型行为。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5624":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-162","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#免费标记","content":"`GET /v1/models` 中每个模型的 `free` 字段有三种值：`true`、`false`、`null`（站点没有说明）。agg 只采信站点自己公布的信息：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5625":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-163","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#免费标记","content":"从目录行读取：`anyapi`、`gmi`、`opengateway`、`orcarouter`、`tokenrouter`、`xkiro`、`bai`（ID 带 `:free`）、`merge`（某条线路输入输出价格都为 0）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5626":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-164","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#免费标记","content":"从站点定价页记录的固定 ID：`agnes`、`bai`、`commandcode`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5627":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-165","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#免费标记","content":"`venice` 和 `llm7` 故意不标记：Venice 的 0 价模型仍要求账号有正余额，LLM7 的标价是公开报价而非账号余额。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5628":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-166","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#免费标记","content":"免费标记只说明站点的价目，不保证账号有额度或一定能调用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5629":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-167","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#站点特有的处理","content":"**聊天模型筛选**：已知站点的目录会去掉图像、视频、嵌入、语音转写等非聊天模型，筛选规则按站点分别实现；目录字段缺失时保留该行，避免站点改版后目录变空。LLM7 按自己的 `model_type` 字段筛选。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5630":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-168","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#站点特有的处理","content":"**CommandCode**：`claude-` 开头的模型改走 Anthropic Messages（`<base_url>/messages`）；站点的视觉和思考能力表作为默认值，账号声明优先。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5631":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-169","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#站点特有的处理","content":"**请求格式**：已知站点的请求把 `max_completion_tokens` 改为 `max_tokens`、`developer` 消息改为 `system`；自定义地址的请求不做这些改写。上游即使对流式请求返回完整的 JSON 文档也能正确读取。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5632":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-170","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#站点特有的处理","content":"这些规则大多移植自 pi-free，差异见从 pi-free 迁移。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5633":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","type":"page","content":"匿名入口","breadcrumbs":["Hoshimi 文档","渠道"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/providers-anonymous","locale":"zh-CN"},"5634":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-0","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous","content":"OpenCode Zen 和 Kilo 两个默认开启、无需账号的免费入口：它们提供什么、怎样关闭、怎样加密钥扩大目录，以及协议上的处理和注意事项。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5635":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-1","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#概览","content":"概览","locale":"zh-CN"},"5636":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-2","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#关闭匿名入口","content":"关闭匿名入口","locale":"zh-CN"},"5637":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-3","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#opencode-zenopencode","content":"OpenCode Zen（`opencode`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5638":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-4","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#匿名使用","content":"匿名使用","locale":"zh-CN"},"5639":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-5","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#用-api-密钥扩大目录","content":"用 API 密钥扩大目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"5640":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-6","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#协议处理","content":"协议处理","locale":"zh-CN"},"5641":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-7","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#思考级别","content":"思考级别","locale":"zh-CN"},"5642":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-8","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#地区与探测","content":"地区与探测","locale":"zh-CN"},"5643":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-9","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#kilokilo","content":"Kilo（`kilo`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5644":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-10","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#匿名使用-1","content":"匿名使用","locale":"zh-CN"},"5645":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-11","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#用密钥或设备码登录","content":"用密钥或设备码登录","locale":"zh-CN"},"5646":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-12","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#请求处理与思考级别","content":"请求处理与思考级别","locale":"zh-CN"},"5647":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-13","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#验证范围","content":"验证范围","locale":"zh-CN"},"5648":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-14","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous","content":"Hoshimi 第一次启动、还没有任何配置时，`opencode`（OpenCode Zen）和 `kilo`（Kilo AI）两个渠道就已经可用：它们带一个不含凭据的占位账号，直接向上游的免费模型发请求。在 **渠道** 页面上，这两个渠道显示 **无需账户**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5649":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-15","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous","content":"模型能否调用取决于上游当前的模型、额度和服务状态，也可能因网络出口所在地区而不同。本页描述的是适配器的实现方式，不是对上游可用性的承诺。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5650":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-16","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#概览","content":"渠道","locale":"zh-CN"},"5651":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-17","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#概览","content":"上游","locale":"zh-CN"},"5652":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-18","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#概览","content":"匿名目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"5653":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-19","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#概览","content":"加账号后","locale":"zh-CN"},"5654":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-20","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#概览","content":"`opencode`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5655":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-21","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#概览","content":"`https://opencode.ai/inference`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5656":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-22","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#概览","content":"实时目录中的免费切片（ID 含 `free`，以及 `big-pickle`、`space-bunny-free`、`union-alpha`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5657":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-23","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#概览","content":"API 密钥账号使用其鉴权目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"5658":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-24","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#概览","content":"`kilo`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5659":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-25","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#概览","content":"`https://api.kilo.ai/api/gateway`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5660":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-26","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#概览","content":"实时目录中标记 `isFree: true` 的聊天模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"5661":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-27","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#概览","content":"API 密钥或设备码登录，目录扩大到该账号可见的全部聊天模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"5662":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-28","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#概览","content":"查看当前可用的 ID：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5663":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-29","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#概览","content":"调用时可以加渠道前缀，例如 `opencode/big-pickle`、`kilo/kilo-auto/free`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5664":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-30","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#关闭匿名入口","content":"匿名入口只能通过 `enabled: false` 关闭（没有账号也会自动启用）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5665":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-31","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#关闭匿名入口","content":"或在 `config.json` 中写入：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5666":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-32","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#关闭匿名入口","content":"在 **渠道** 页面中关闭渠道开关也是同样的效果。重新开启时把 `enabled` 改回 `true` 或删除这一项。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5667":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-33","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#匿名使用","content":"未关闭时，`opencode` 使用一个占位账号（`opencode-public`）。网关读取上游 `/v1/models`，只保留免费切片：ID 中以 `free` 作为独立片段的模型（如 `mimo-v2.6-flash-free`），以及固定视为免费的 `big-pickle`、`space-bunny-free`、`union-alpha`。新出现的免费 ID 保留上游原样拼写。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5668":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-34","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#匿名使用","content":"实时目录优先。刷新失败时保留上一次成功的目录；只有冷启动且目录不可达时，才使用内置的历史回退列表。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5669":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-35","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#用-api-密钥扩大目录","content":"在 **渠道** › **OpenCode Zen** 中点 **添加账号**，鉴权方式选 **API 密钥**；或写入 `config.json`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5670":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-36","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#用-api-密钥扩大目录","content":"有账号后，渠道只使用你配置的账号，匿名占位账号不再加入。账号中没有 `api_key` 时，该账号按匿名方式发送请求。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5671":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-37","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#用-api-密钥扩大目录","content":"第一个账号带密钥时，目录不再只保留免费切片，可用范围仍受密钥权限限制。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5672":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-38","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#用-api-密钥扩大目录","content":"`project_id` 作为 `x-opencode-project` 头发送，默认 `global`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5673":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-39","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#用-api-密钥扩大目录","content":"OpenCode Go 套餐是另一个渠道 `opencode-go`，见本地与兼容端点。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5674":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-40","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#协议处理","content":"匿名通道按 OpenCode v2.2.1 的实际请求对齐。2026-10-29 对 `deepseek-v4.1-flash-free` 的实测中，默认 Python/httpx 返回 `FreeUsageLimitError`；将 TLS 1.2 和 TLS 1.3 的密码套件列表及顺序与 Bun 对齐后，Python 传输返回 200。该调整不等于复制完整的 Bun TLS 指纹，其他出口和后续配额仍以上游响应为准。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5675":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-41","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#协议处理","content":"匿名推理由 Python 进程内的 pyOpenSSL 传输处理，无需安装 Bun 或 OpenCode，也不启动子进程。依赖随 Hoshimi 安装，网络诊断记录 `transport: pyopenssl`。收到 429 或网络错误后不会换传输重发。目录查询、API 密钥账号和其他提供商继续使用原有传输。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5676":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-42","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#协议处理","content":"传输沿用公共并发控制、代理策略和 httpcore 连接池，支持 HTTP/HTTPS、SOCKS5/SOCKS5H 代理、增量流式响应、连接及读写超时，提前关闭流会释放连接。TLS 保留证书链与主机名校验；信任根沿用 HTTPX 的默认 CA，或 `SSL_CERT_FILE` / `SSL_CERT_DIR` 配置。不修改进程全局 SSL 配置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5677":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-43","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#协议处理","content":"请求发往 `/inference/openai/v1` 或 `/inference/anthropic/v1`。匿名调用保留 OpenCode 的 `User-Agent`，其他客户端使用 `opencode/latest/2.2.1/cli`；发送 `x-opencode-client: cli`，不发送旧的 `x-opencode-request`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5678":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-44","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#协议处理","content":"保留调用方的 OpenCode 会话 ID 和 `x-opencode-project`，凭据仍来自渠道配置。四个会话及 affinity 头使用同一 ID。Chat Completions 使用 `max_completion_tokens`，请求流式 usage，不再自动注入 `prompt_cache_key`；Responses 仍默认使用会话 ID 作为缓存键。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5679":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-45","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#协议处理","content":"Playground 会话以及其他调用的 `session_id`、`conversation_id`、`user` 或首条用户消息映射到带真实创建时间的降序 ID，按账号隔离，进程内缓存最多 8192 个映射。压缩历史和后续回复沿用该 ID；重启或缓存淘汰后重新生成。相同开场白的独立对话应提供不同会话 ID。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5680":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-46","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#协议处理","content":"匿名请求保留已有系统环境上下文；缺失时补充 `<env>` 格式，明确目录未由调用方提供、平台未知，不附带网关本机路径、文件或技能内容。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5681":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-47","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#协议处理","content":"模型协议优先使用 `options.model_protocols`，其次使用目录声明，最后按已知模型推断。`deepseek-v4.1-flash-free` 使用 `/inference/openai/v1/chat/completions`，`muse-spark-*` 使用 `/inference/openai/v1/responses`，`union-alpha` 使用 `/inference/anthropic/v1/messages`。目录仍从 `/inference/v1/models` 获取。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5682":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-48","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#协议处理","content":"HTTP 或流式响应中的 `FreeUsageLimitError`、`GoUsageLimitError` 按账号与模型暂缓调用，保留上游错误类型，不会当作登录失效。`FreeTierError` 表示客户端限制；协议对齐无法保证消除上游额度或访问策略限制。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5683":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-49","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#协议处理","content":"匿名请求会声明参考实现中的 `read` 和 `shell` 两个工具定义（上游会比对工具描述）。调用方自己的同名但定义不同的工具会改名（如 `read_client`）后发送，历史记录和强制选择中一致改名，响应中再还原。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5684":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-50","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#协议处理","content":"匿名通道将 `exec_command`、`write_stdin`、`kill_session` 映射为 `terminal_execute`、`terminal_send`、`terminal_stop`，避免上游将该工具组合拒绝为 `FreeUsageLimitError`。工具描述、参数和执行功能保留，历史调用及强制选择同步映射，返回调用方时恢复原名；与调用方现有名称冲突时使用数字后缀。API 密钥账号不使用此映射。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5685":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-51","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#协议处理","content":"这两个注入的工具调用方并不能执行。模型只调用了调用方没有提供的工具时，网关回答它 `unsupported call: <name>` 并在同一会话中再问一次，最多两轮；模型仍坚持调用时返回 502 错误。调用方看到的只有文本和自己工具的调用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5686":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-52","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#协议处理","content":"调用方设置 `tool_choice: \"none\"` 时，上游请求中省略该字段，由网关保证不把任何工具调用交给调用方。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5687":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-53","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#协议处理","content":"带 API 密钥的账号不做以上工具处理，调用方的工具按原样发送。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5688":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-54","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#思考级别","content":"以下 ID 使用参考实现中声明的思考菜单；其余 ID 按共享的能力表处理（见模型行为）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5689":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-55","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#思考级别","content":"模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"5690":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-56","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#思考级别","content":"级别","locale":"zh-CN"},"5691":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-57","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#思考级别","content":"默认","locale":"zh-CN"},"5692":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-58","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#思考级别","content":"可关闭思考","locale":"zh-CN"},"5693":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-59","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#思考级别","content":"`deepseek-v4.1-flash-free`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5694":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-60","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#思考级别","content":"`disabled`、`low`、`high`、`max`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5695":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-61","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#思考级别","content":"`high`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5696":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-62","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#思考级别","content":"是","locale":"zh-CN"},"5697":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-63","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#思考级别","content":"`glm-5.3-flash-free`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5698":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-64","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#思考级别","content":"`low`、`high`、`max`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5699":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-65","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#思考级别","content":"`high`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5700":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-66","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#思考级别","content":"否","locale":"zh-CN"},"5701":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-67","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#思考级别","content":"`nemotron-3.5-super-vl-free`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5702":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-68","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#思考级别","content":"`disabled`、`minimal`、`low`、`medium`、`high`、`xhigh`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5703":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-69","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#思考级别","content":"`high`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5704":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-70","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#思考级别","content":"是","locale":"zh-CN"},"5705":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-71","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#思考级别","content":"`space-bunny-free`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5706":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-72","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#思考级别","content":"`low`、`medium`、`high`、`xhigh`、`max`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5707":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-73","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#思考级别","content":"`high`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5708":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-74","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#思考级别","content":"否","locale":"zh-CN"},"5709":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-75","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#思考级别","content":"级别通过 `reasoning_effort` 字段发送。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5710":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-76","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#地区与探测","content":"目录只列出 ID，无法说明当前网络出口能否使用某个模型；`muse-spark` 系列被标记为与地区相关。`opencode` 参与默认的可用性探测，可以在 **模型** 页面或通过 `POST /api/v1/probe` 实际请求一次来确认，见模型行为。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5711":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-77","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#匿名使用-1","content":"未关闭时，`kilo` 使用占位账号（`kilo-public`），不带任何凭据请求 Kilo 网关。目录只保留上游标记 `isFree: true` 的聊天模型（排除嵌入、图像、音频等），付费 ID 不带密钥只会返回 401。冷启动且目录不可达时使用内置的历史回退列表（如 `kilo-auto/free`、`openrouter/free`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5712":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-78","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#匿名使用-1","content":"匿名免费池没有任何凭据保护，免费模型背后的上游可能记录提示词。不要通过它发送敏感内容。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5713":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-79","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#用密钥或设备码登录","content":"有两种方式添加 Kilo 账号：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5714":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-80","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#用密钥或设备码登录","content":"终端打印验证链接和验证码（网页界面中点 **登录**，对话框显示 **验证码**），在浏览器中确认后账号写入 `config.json`。Kilo 返回的是长期有效的密钥，不是可续期的 OAuth 令牌，因此不会定时续期。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5715":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-81","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#用密钥或设备码登录","content":"也可以在 **添加账号** 中直接填 API 密钥，或写入 `config.json`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5716":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-82","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#用密钥或设备码登录","content":"账号接受 `api_key`、`access_token` 或 `token` 中的任一个。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5717":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-83","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#用密钥或设备码登录","content":"有带凭据的账号时，目录包含该账号可见的全部聊天模型；设置 `options.free_only: true` 仍只保留免费模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5718":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-84","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#用密钥或设备码登录","content":"和 `opencode` 一样，有账号后匿名占位账号不再加入；没有凭据的账号按匿名方式请求。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5719":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-85","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#请求处理与思考级别","content":"请求使用 OpenAI Chat Completions；`max_completion_tokens` 改写为 `max_tokens`，`developer` 消息改为 `system`，工具定义去掉 `strict`，并移除 `store` 和 `reasoning_effort`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5720":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-86","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#请求处理与思考级别","content":"思考级别来自目录行中声明的能力，通过 `reasoning: {\"effort\": ...}` 发送，关闭思考时发送 `reasoning: {\"enabled\": false}`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5721":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-87","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#请求处理与思考级别","content":"`stepfun/`、`liquid/`、`thinkingmachines/` 前缀的模型要求必须思考，`kilo-auto/free` 和 `openrouter/free` 接受参数但仍会思考，它们的菜单中没有关闭选项。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5722":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-88","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#请求处理与思考级别","content":"Kilo 不参与默认的可用性探测：匿名目录本身就是免费池的结论。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5723":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-89","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#验证范围","content":"`tests/core/test_opencode_lane.py`、`tests/core/test_pi_free_parity.py` 和协议测试覆盖的是本地回归，不能替代从某个网络出口实际请求成功。模型是否可用、地区限制和额度，以上游当前的响应或一次显式探测为准。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5724":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","type":"page","content":"云平台","breadcrumbs":["Hoshimi 文档","渠道"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/providers-cloud","locale":"zh-CN"},"5725":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-0","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud","content":"接入 Azure OpenAI、Cloudflare Workers AI 与 AI Gateway、Gemini Developer API、Vertex AI、Amazon Bedrock，以及 Radius 和 TypeSafe 这两个特殊协议：凭据、账号字段、协议选择和限制。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5726":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-1","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/providers-cloud#可选依赖","content":"可选依赖","locale":"zh-CN"},"5727":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-2","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/providers-cloud#azure-openaiazure","content":"Azure OpenAI（`azure`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5728":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-3","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/providers-cloud#cloudflarecloudflare-workers-aicloudflare-ai-gateway","content":"Cloudflare（`cloudflare-workers-ai`、`cloudflare-ai-gateway`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5729":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-4","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/providers-cloud#gemini-developer-apigoogle","content":"Gemini Developer API（`google`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5730":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-5","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/providers-cloud#google-vertex-aigoogle-vertex","content":"Google Vertex AI（`google-vertex`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5731":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-6","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/providers-cloud#amazon-bedrockamazon-bedrock","content":"Amazon Bedrock（`amazon-bedrock`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5732":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-7","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/providers-cloud#radiusradius","content":"Radius（`radius`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5733":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-8","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/providers-cloud#typesafetypesafe","content":"TypeSafe（`typesafe`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5734":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-9","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/providers-cloud#协议选择","content":"协议选择","locale":"zh-CN"},"5735":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-10","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud","content":"本页的渠道都需要你自己的云平台账号。按上游端点、协议、凭据和套餐选择对应的渠道 ID；模型名相似不代表凭据通用。例如 `gemini` 是 Code Assist（见免费站点），`google` 是 Gemini Developer API，`google-vertex` 是 Vertex AI；`amazon-bedrock` 和 `bedrock-mantle` 是两个分别配置的服务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5736":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-11","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud","content":"下面的 JSON 都是数据目录 `config.json` 中 `providers` 下的片段，不是放在程序旁边的文件。替换占位符，只开启用到的渠道；编辑文件后重启。在 **渠道** 中 **添加账号** 会立即生效，表单按 **鉴权方式** 分别给出需要填写的字段。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5737":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-12","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#可选依赖","content":"Vertex 的默认凭据和服务账号需要 Google 认证库，Bedrock 需要 AWS SDK：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5738":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-13","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#可选依赖","content":"Vertex 的 API 密钥模式和普通 HTTP 渠道不需要这些依赖。缺少依赖或凭据时，请求返回明确的错误，不会退回匿名访问。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5739":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-14","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#azure-openaiazure","content":"填写 Azure 资源名、密钥、对外的模型 ID 和部署名映射：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5740":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-15","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#azure-openaiazure","content":"字段","locale":"zh-CN"},"5741":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-16","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#azure-openaiazure","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"5742":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-17","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#azure-openaiazure","content":"`resource`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5743":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-18","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#azure-openaiazure","content":"资源名，默认根地址为 `https://<resource>.openai.azure.com/openai/v1`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5744":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-19","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#azure-openaiazure","content":"`base_url`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5745":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-20","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#azure-openaiazure","content":"可选，替代由 `resource` 生成的地址。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5746":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-21","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#azure-openaiazure","content":"`api_key`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5747":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-22","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#azure-openaiazure","content":"以 `api-key` 头发送。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5748":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-23","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#azure-openaiazure","content":"`models`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5749":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-24","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#azure-openaiazure","content":"对外公布的模型 ID（网页表单中必填）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5750":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-25","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#azure-openaiazure","content":"`deployments`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5751":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-26","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#azure-openaiazure","content":"模型 ID 到部署名的映射。上游请求中的 `model` 换成部署名，能力和协议仍按对外的 ID 查找。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5752":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-27","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#azure-openaiazure","content":"`protocol`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5753":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-28","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#azure-openaiazure","content":"默认使用 Responses；设为 `\"chat\"` 使用 Chat Completions。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5754":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-29","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#cloudflarecloudflare-workers-aicloudflare-ai-gateway","content":"Workers AI 需要账户 ID；AI Gateway 还需要网关 ID：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5755":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-30","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#cloudflarecloudflare-workers-aicloudflare-ai-gateway","content":"**Workers AI**：地址为 `https://api.cloudflare.com/client/v4/accounts/<account_id>/ai/v1`。模型目录读取 Cloudflare 原生的模型搜索接口，只保留文本生成任务；账号中声明 `models` 时以声明为准。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5756":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-31","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#cloudflarecloudflare-workers-aicloudflare-ai-gateway","content":"**AI Gateway**：Chat 请求发往 `https://gateway.ai.cloudflare.com/v1/<account_id>/<gateway_id>/compat`，密钥以 `cf-aig-authorization` 头发送。选择 Messages 协议时改走网关的 `/anthropic/v1/messages`，Responses 协议走 `/openai/responses`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5757":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-32","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#cloudflarecloudflare-workers-aicloudflare-ai-gateway","content":"两者都可以用 `base_url` 替换生成的地址。只为上游确实支持的协议设置 `protocol` 或 `model_protocols`（见本页末尾）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5758":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-33","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#gemini-developer-apigoogle","content":"默认使用原生 Gemini 流式接口（`generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta`），密钥以 `x-goog-api-key` 发送。`protocol: \"chat\"` 改用 Google 的 OpenAI 兼容 Chat 端点。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5759":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-34","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#gemini-developer-apigoogle","content":"模型目录读取原生模型列表（分页），只保留支持 `generateContent` 的模型；也可以用 `models` 声明。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5760":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-35","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#gemini-developer-apigoogle","content":"原生转换保留函数调用及其不透明的思考签名，多轮工具调用可以正确回放。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5761":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-36","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#gemini-developer-apigoogle","content":"思考级别通过 `reasoning_effort` 设置，也可以直接传 Google 的 `thinking_config`（两者不能同时使用）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5762":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-37","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#gemini-developer-apigoogle","content":"这个渠道不使用 `gemini` 渠道的 Code Assist 登录账号。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5763":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-38","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#google-vertex-aigoogle-vertex","content":"三种鉴权方式任选其一：API 密钥、应用默认凭据（ADC）或服务账号文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5764":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-39","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#google-vertex-aigoogle-vertex","content":"鉴权方式","locale":"zh-CN"},"5765":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-40","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#google-vertex-aigoogle-vertex","content":"账号字段","locale":"zh-CN"},"5766":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-41","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#google-vertex-aigoogle-vertex","content":"**API 密钥**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5767":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-42","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#google-vertex-aigoogle-vertex","content":"`api_key`，可选 `project`、`location`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5768":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-43","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#google-vertex-aigoogle-vertex","content":"**Google 默认凭据**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5769":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-44","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#google-vertex-aigoogle-vertex","content":"`auth: \"adc\"`、`project`（必填）、可选 `location`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5770":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-45","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#google-vertex-aigoogle-vertex","content":"**Google 服务账号文件**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5771":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-46","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#google-vertex-aigoogle-vertex","content":"`service_account_file`（服务器上的路径）、`project`（必填）、可选 `location`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5772":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-47","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#google-vertex-aigoogle-vertex","content":"ADC 和服务账号需要安装 `hoshimi[google]`，凭据要对运行 Hoshimi 的进程可见。凭据缺失或过期时报告错误，不会切换到别的方式。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5773":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-48","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#google-vertex-aigoogle-vertex","content":"`location` 默认 `global`，填区域名（如 `us-central1`）则使用区域端点。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5774":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-49","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#google-vertex-aigoogle-vertex","content":"默认使用原生 Gemini 协议；`protocol: \"chat\"` 连接 Vertex 的 OpenAI 兼容端点，此时必须提供 `project`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5775":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-50","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#google-vertex-aigoogle-vertex","content":"模型目录读取 Google 发布者模型列表；账号授权的模型可以用 `models` 声明来代替。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5776":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-51","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#amazon-bedrockamazon-bedrock","content":"使用 Bedrock ConverseStream。所有鉴权方式都需要安装 `hoshimi[bedrock]`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5777":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-52","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#amazon-bedrockamazon-bedrock","content":"鉴权方式","locale":"zh-CN"},"5778":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-53","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#amazon-bedrockamazon-bedrock","content":"账号字段","locale":"zh-CN"},"5779":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-54","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#amazon-bedrockamazon-bedrock","content":"**AWS 默认凭据**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5780":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-55","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#amazon-bedrockamazon-bedrock","content":"`auth: \"aws\"`，使用 AWS 凭据链","locale":"zh-CN"},"5781":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-56","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#amazon-bedrockamazon-bedrock","content":"**AWS 配置档案**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5782":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-57","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#amazon-bedrockamazon-bedrock","content":"`profile`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5783":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-58","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#amazon-bedrockamazon-bedrock","content":"**AWS 访问密钥**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5784":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-59","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#amazon-bedrockamazon-bedrock","content":"`aws_access_key_id`、`aws_secret_access_key`，可选 `aws_session_token`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5785":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-60","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#amazon-bedrockamazon-bedrock","content":"**API 密钥**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5786":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-61","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#amazon-bedrockamazon-bedrock","content":"`api_key`（Bedrock Bearer 密钥），必须声明 `models`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5787":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-62","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#amazon-bedrockamazon-bedrock","content":"`region` 默认 `us-east-1`。Bearer 模式可以用 `base_url` 替换 `https://bedrock-runtime.<region>.amazonaws.com`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5788":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-63","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#amazon-bedrockamazon-bedrock","content":"SDK 模式可以列出支持流式输出的文本基础模型；Bearer 密钥无权调用控制面的模型列表，所以要声明 `models`。账号专属的推理配置文件 ID 或 ARN 也应显式声明。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5789":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-64","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#amazon-bedrockamazon-bedrock","content":"适配器转换消息、支持的图片、工具调用与结果、用量和思考签名；请求体中的 `thinking` 对象作为附加模型参数传给上游。不是每个 Bedrock 模型都支持全部功能，模型授权仍由 AWS 账号决定。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5790":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-65","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#amazon-bedrockamazon-bedrock","content":"`bedrock-mantle` 是另一个服务：Bedrock 的 OpenAI 兼容端点，用 Bearer 密钥和自己的地址（默认 `https://bedrock-mantle.us-east-1.api.aws/v1`）单独配置：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5791":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-66","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#radiusradius","content":"Radius 使用专用的 pi-messages 协议，而不是通用的 Chat 端点。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5792":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-67","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#radiusradius","content":"**添加账号**：`hoshimi login radius`（设备码登录，令牌可续期），或在 **添加账号** 中填 API 密钥。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5793":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-68","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#radiusradius","content":"**模型**：从网关的 `/v1/config` 读取推理地址和模型列表。账号的 `gateway` 字段可以替换默认网关 `https://radius.pi.dev`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5794":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-69","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#typesafetypesafe","content":"TypeSafe 是分类服务，不是聊天模型：它的模型不出现在 `/v1/models` 中，也不能用于聊天。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5795":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-70","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#typesafetypesafe","content":"`classifiers` 可选，默认 `[\"jev-latest\"]`。可用的分类模型通过 `GET /v1/classifiers` 列出，分类请求发往 `POST /v1/classify`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5796":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-71","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#typesafetypesafe","content":"`model` 取自 `/v1/classifiers`，形如 `typesafe/<classifier>`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5797":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-72","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#typesafetypesafe","content":"`state` 是一个对象，`questions` 是非空对象；两者的内容原样交给 TypeSafe。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5798":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-73","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#typesafetypesafe","content":"每个问题的 `type` 为 `bool`、`score` 或 `choice`。`bool` 返回概率，`score` 和 `choice` 返回分数或选项及置信度。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5799":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-74","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#typesafetypesafe","content":"不支持图片输入。各字段的完整定义见运行中服务器的 `/docs`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5800":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-75","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#协议选择","content":"`azure`、`cloudflare-ai-gateway` 等渠道能讲多种协议。按以下顺序决定一个模型走哪种协议：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5801":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-76","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#协议选择","content":"渠道选项 `options.model_protocols` 中为该模型指定的协议，例如 `{\"claude-sonnet\": \"messages\"}`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5802":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-77","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#协议选择","content":"账号的 `protocol` 字段。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5803":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-78","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#协议选择","content":"目录中该模型自带的协议信息。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5804":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-79","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#协议选择","content":"渠道的默认协议。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5805":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-80","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#协议选择","content":"可用的值为 `chat`、`responses`、`messages`，也接受别名 `openai-completions`、`openai-responses`、`anthropic-messages`。`google` 和 `google-vertex` 使用 `gemini` 或 `chat`。只为上游确实支持的协议设置这些值。更多协议相关选项见本地与兼容端点。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5806":{"id":"/docs/providers-cloud-81","page_id":"/docs/providers-cloud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-cloud#协议选择","content":"可用性需要用配置好的账号实际请求来确认；本页描述的是已实现的配置行为。完整的服务对照见渠道清单。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5807":{"id":"/docs/providers-inventory","page_id":"/docs/providers-inventory","type":"page","content":"渠道来源清单","