ders-nvidia-3","page_id":"/docs/providers-nvidia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/providers-nvidia#目录","content":"目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"7392":{"id":"/docs/providers-nvidia-4","page_id":"/docs/providers-nvidia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/providers-nvidia#请求转换","content":"请求转换","locale":"zh-CN"},"7393":{"id":"/docs/providers-nvidia-5","page_id":"/docs/providers-nvidia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-nvidia","content":"`nvidia` 渠道连接 NVIDIA 托管的 NIM 推理服务（`https://integrate.api.nvidia.com/v1`），使用 OpenAI Chat Completions 协议，账号只需要一个 NVIDIA API 密钥。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7394":{"id":"/docs/providers-nvidia-6","page_id":"/docs/providers-nvidia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-nvidia#添加账号","content":"打开 **渠道** › **NVIDIA NIM**，点 **添加账号**，填写 **API 密钥**，点 **保存账号**。账号立即生效。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7395":{"id":"/docs/providers-nvidia-7","page_id":"/docs/providers-nvidia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-nvidia#添加账号","content":"用 `hoshimi config path` 找到配置文件，加入：","locale":"zh-CN"},"7396":{"id":"/docs/providers-nvidia-8","page_id":"/docs/providers-nvidia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-nvidia#添加账号","content":"编辑文件后重启服务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7397":{"id":"/docs/providers-nvidia-9","page_id":"/docs/providers-nvidia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-nvidia#添加账号","content":"账号也接受 `access_token` 代替 `api_key`，账号上的 `models` 可以声明模型列表代替实时目录；渠道选项 `options.base_url` 可以替换默认地址。这个上游密钥与网关自己的模型 API 密钥、管理密钥是三样不同的东西，见安全。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7398":{"id":"/docs/providers-nvidia-10","page_id":"/docs/providers-nvidia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-nvidia#选择模型","content":"用 `nvidia/<model-id>` 显式指定这个渠道。模型 ID 本身带斜杠时，加上 `nvidia/` 前缀可以确保请求落到这里，而不是按渠道顺序先匹配到别的渠道：","locale":"zh-CN"},"7399":{"id":"/docs/providers-nvidia-11","page_id":"/docs/providers-nvidia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-nvidia#目录","content":"适配器实时读取模型列表，并排除已识别的非聊天任务：嵌入（`embed`）、重排（`rerank`）、`nvclip`、奖励评分（`-reward`）、检测器（`-dete