`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7547":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-128","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#clinecline","content":"**登录**：`hoshimi login cline` 默认走 WorkOS 设备授权，然后向 Cline 注册换取站点令牌。令牌带 `workos:` 前缀保存，每次请求原样发送。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7548":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-129","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#clinecline","content":"**登录方式**：渠道详情的 **网络** 部分有 **Cline 登录方式**，可选 **设备码（SDK）**（默认）或 **浏览器（扩展）**，对应 `providers.cline.options.client_profile` 的 `sdk` 和 `extension`。扩展方式在本机 48801–48811 端口中找一个接收回调，支持手动粘贴回调地址。新账号记录登录时的方式，切换选项只影响之后的登录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7549":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-130","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#clinecline","content":"**余额**：需要账号中的 `account_id`（形如 `usr-…`，登录时自动保存）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7550":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-131","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#clinecline","content":"**账号字段**：`access_token`、`refresh_token`、`client_profile`、`account_id`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7551":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-132","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#gemini-code-assistgemini","content":"Google Code Assist 通道（`daily-cloudcode-pa.googleapis.com`），用 Google 账号登录。它和 Gemini Developer API（`google`）、Vertex AI（`google-vertex`）是不同的服务，见云平台。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7552":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-133","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#gemini-code-assistgemini","content":"**登录**：`hoshimi login gemini` 打开 Google 授权页，回调到本机 `localhost` 的临时端口；支持手动粘贴回调地址。登录时把公开桌面客户端的 `client_id` 和 `client_secret` 一并存入账号，续期不需要额外配置。`options.client_id` / `options.client_secret` 可以覆盖它们。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7553":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-134","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#gemini-code-assistgemini","content":"**模型**：只有一个 `gemini-3.8-flash`，思考级别 `low`、`medium`、`high`、`tiered`（未指定时为 `medium`）。级别决定思考预算，并作为后缀拼到上游模型名上。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7554":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-135","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#gemini-code-assistgemini","content":"**余额**：显示五小时和每周两个额度窗口的剩余比例，不是积分。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7555":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-136","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#zcodezcode","content":"智谱 ZCode 客户端的免费套餐通道，使用 Anthropic Messages 协议。模型为 `GLM-5.3-Flash` 和 `GLM-5.3`，思考级别 `low`、`high`、`max`，通过 `output_config.effort` 发送。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7556":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-137","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#zcodezcode","content":"**登录**：`hoshimi login zcode` 由站点中转完成，用智谱账号授权，不需要本地回调，适合远程服务器。登录时生成并保存一个固定的 `device_mid`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7557":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-138","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#zcodezcode","content":"**续期**：适配器不续期，令牌失效后重新登录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7558":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-139","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#zcodezcode","content":"**注意**：适配器在调用方的系统提示词之前加上 ZCode 官方客户端的身份说明和环境说明，并在第一条用户消息前插入日期提醒。调用方的系统提示词仍然保留，排在这些内容之后。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7559":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-140","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#zcodezcode","content":"**选项**：`options.app_version`（默认 `3.14.3`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7560":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-141","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#zcodezcode","content":"**账号字段**：`zcode_jwt`（或 `access_token`）、`device_mid`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7561":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-142","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#minimaxminimax","content":"MiniMax Agent 的登录通道（Anthropic Messages 协议），与按密钥计费的 `minimax-api`、`minimax-cn`、`minimax-chat` 无关。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7562":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-143","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#minimaxminimax","content":"**登录**：`hoshimi login minimax` 使用 `account.minimax.cn` 的设备码，同时校验 PKCE。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7563":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-144","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#minimaxminimax","content":"**模型**：`MiniMax-M3.1-Flash-Preview`、`MiniMax-M3`、`MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed`、`MiniMax-M2.7`。M3.1 系列必须使用自适应思考，适配器在未指定级别时也会打开；M2.7 没有声明级别，调用方的级别不会转发。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7564":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-145","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#minimaxminimax","content":"**签到与余额**：按北京时间领取每日积分；余额为各积分包剩余量之和。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7565":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-146","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#minimaxminimax","content":"**账号字段**：`access_token`、`refresh_token`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7566":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-147","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#traetrae","content":"字节跳动 TRAE 国内版的 SOLO 通道（`api.trae.com.cn`、`trae-api-cn.mchost.guru`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7567":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-148","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#traetrae","content":"**登录**：`hoshimi login trae` 打开 `www.trae.cn` 的登录页，站点把令牌直接回调到本机，端口优先 18080，被占用时换一个空闲端口；支持手动粘贴回调地址。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7568":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-149","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#traetrae","content":"**模型**：回退列表包括 `DeepSeek-V4-Flash-Official`、`Doubao-Seed-2.1-Pro`、`glm-5.2`、`kimi-k3` 等。TRAE 只提供上下文长度表，不提供思考菜单，调用方的 `reasoning_effort` 原样转发。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7569":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-150","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#traetrae","content":"**签到与余额**：设备身份由账号的 `uid` 推导，缺少 `uid` 的账号无法签到。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7570":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-151","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#traetrae","content":"**账号字段**：`access_token`、`refresh_token`、`device_id`、`machine_id`、`uid`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7571":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-152","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#traetrae","content":"选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"7572":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-153","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#traetrae","content":"默认值","locale":"zh-CN"},"7573":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-154","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#traetrae","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"7574":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-155","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#traetrae","content":"`channel`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7575":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-156","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#traetrae","content":"`solo_work_lite`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7576":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-157","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#traetrae","content":"请求使用的功能通道","locale":"zh-CN"},"7577":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-158","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#traetrae","content":"`user_agent`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7578":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-159","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#traetrae","content":"`Trae/0.1.52`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7579":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-160","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#traetrae","content":"User-Agent","locale":"zh-CN"},"7580":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-161","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#traetrae","content":"`app_id`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7581":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-162","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#traetrae","content":"内置值","locale":"zh-CN"},"7582":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-163","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#traetrae","content":"`X-App-Id`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7583":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-164","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#traetrae","content":"`ide_version`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7584":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-165","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#traetrae","content":"`0.1.52`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7585":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-166","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#traetrae","content":"`X-Ide-Version`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7586":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-167","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#traetrae","content":"`ide_version_code`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7587":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-168","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#traetrae","content":"`20260811`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7588":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-169","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#traetrae","content":"`X-Ide-Version-Code`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7589":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-170","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#traetrae","content":"`os_version`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7590":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-171","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#traetrae","content":"`macOS 15.7.4`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7591":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-172","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#traetrae","content":"`X-OS-Version`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7592":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-173","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#traetrae","content":"`device_brand`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7593":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-174","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#traetrae","content":"`Apple`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7594":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-175","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#traetrae","content":"`X-Device-Brand`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7595":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-176","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#qoderqoderqodercn","content":"阿里 Qoder 的国际版（`qoder`，`openapi.qoder.sh`）和国内版（`qodercn`，`openapi.qoder.com.cn`）是两个渠道，账号和模型都不通用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7596":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-177","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#qoderqoderqodercn","content":"**登录**：`hoshimi login qoder` 或 `hoshimi login qodercn` 打开 `qoder.com` / `qoder.cn` 的设备授权页，网关轮询结果，不需要本地回调。登录时生成一个 `machine_id`，续期请求会带上它，账号要一直保留它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7597":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-178","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#qoderqoderqodercn","content":"**模型**：两个站点的模型表不同。国际版 17 个（`auto`、`ultimate`、`performance`、`efficient`、`smodel`、`cmodel`、`qmodel_38max` 等），国内版 14 个（含国内独有的 `q37fmodel`、`gm51model`）；把一个站点独有的 ID 发给另一个站点必然失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7598":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-179","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#qoderqoderqodercn","content":"**签到**：领取活动奖励需要 Qoder 桌面客户端缓存的机器令牌。适配器在 `%APPDATA%`、`~/Library/Application Support` 或 `~/.config` 下的 `Qoder`（或 `Qoder CN`）`/SharedClientCache/cache/machine_token.json` 中查找；运行 Hoshimi 的机器没有安装 Qoder 桌面版时签到会失败。站点的活动在北京时间 10:00 刷新。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7599":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-180","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#qoderqoderqodercn","content":"**注意**：官方客户端走加密的 WASM 推理路径，Hoshimi 使用公开的 OpenAI 兼容端点，该端点可能返回 `503`。请求头、模型和续期行为一致，不代表推理效果与官方客户端完全相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7600":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-181","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#qoderqoderqodercn","content":"**账号字段**：`access_token`、`security_oauth_token`、`refresh_token`、`machine_id`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7601":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-182","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#qoder-cliqodercliqodercli-cn","content":"同样是两个版本，但走官方 Qoder CLI 的路径：带签名的 `agent_chat_generation` 端点，而不是公开的 OpenAI 兼容端点。逻辑完整移植自 `pi-provider-qoder` 插件，包含其客户端伪装。这两个渠道与 `qoder` / `qodercn` 相互独立（凭据、模型表都不通用），可以同时配置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7602":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-183","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#qoder-cliqodercliqodercli-cn","content":"**登录**：`hoshimi login qodercli --manual`（或 `qodercli-cn`）打开账号的集成页面并等待粘贴个人访问令牌。令牌在 https\\://qoder.com/account/integrations（国际版）或 https\\://qoder.com.cn/account/integrations（国内版）创建。网页界面中 **登录** 会显示同样的粘贴框，**添加账号 → 个人访问令牌** 则直接保存令牌。导出 `QODER_API_KEY` / `QODER_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN` / `QODER_PAT`（国内版为 `QODERCN_*`）时，渠道无需交互即可登录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7603":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-184","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#qoder-cliqodercliqodercli-cn","content":"**浏览器登录（仅国际版）**：不加 `--manual` 的 `hoshimi login qodercli` 会打开 Qoder 设备授权页并轮询授权结果，同一会话仍可粘贴 PAT，两者先到先用。国内版没有设备流程。浏览器凭据不含 PAT，因此续期走 `{center}/algo/api/v3/user/refresh_token`，而不是重新交换。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7604":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-185","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#qoder-cliqodercliqodercli-cn","content":"**令牌交换**：`pt-…` 不是 API 凭据。适配器在 `{openApi}/api/v1/jobToken/exchange` 用它换取作业令牌（`jt-…`，一天有效）和作业刷新令牌，再从 `/api/v1/userinfo` 读取账号身份，续期时重新交换。PAT 会保留在账号里以便重复交换；站点拒绝 PAT 时账号退出轮换，直到重新登录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7605":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-186","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#qoder-cliqodercliqodercli-cn","content":"**请求签名**：目录与对话请求都带 `Authorization: Bearer COSY.<payload>.<sig>`。payload 用 AES-128-CBC（密钥同时作为 IV）加密身份，AES 密钥再经 RSA 加密；签名是对 payload、密钥、时间戳、实际发送的编码正文与签名路径的 MD5。请求头声明 CLI 客户端身份（`Cosy-Clienttype: 5`、机器 id/类型/OS、`Cosy-Data-Policy: disagree`、`Login-Version: v2`）。客户端版本跟随 Qoder CLI 最新发布（每天检查一次，缓存在数据目录），因为网关会给版本落后的客户端返回精简的模型表。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7606":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-187","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#qoder-cliqodercliqodercli-cn","content":"**正文编码**：对话正文使用 Qoder 自定义 Base64（`Encode=1`）——替换字母表、`$` 补位、三段块重排。`region/endpoints` 的响应也是同一编码。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7607":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-188","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#qoder-cliqodercliqodercli-cn","content":"**节点**：对话路由到账号的 `dataNodeMap.remote_agent` 节点（官方 CLI 使用的节点），模型目录仍走推理节点。解析结果缓存一小时。`403 code 110「Billing daily count exceeded」` 按节点计数，因此适配器会轮换其余候选节点，并记住真正服务了请求的那个。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7608":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-189","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#qoder-cliqodercliqodercli-cn","content":"**模型**：从 `algo/api/v2/model/list` 实时发现。对外 ID 是目录 `display_name` 去掉空白（`Auto`、`Qwen3.8-Max`、`DeepSeek-V4-Pro` 等），上游 key（`auto`、`qmodel_38max`、`dmodel`）只在请求内部传递。上下文取目录中最大的可选值（常见 1M），输出上限 131072，思考菜单来自各模型自己的 `thinking_config`。两个版本的静态回退表不同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7609":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-190","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#qoder-cliqodercliqodercli-cn","content":"**思考**：级别写在信封的 `parameters` 里（`enable_thinking`，effort 型模型另加 `reasoning_effort`）。关闭需要两个信号；没有 `disabled` 分支的模型只发开关，因为它会拒绝 `reasoning_effort: \"none\"`。泄漏的 `<thinking>` 标签与 DSML 工具调用标记会被清理；只产出标记、没有正文也没有工具调用的回合会作为可重试错误上报，而不是当作已完成。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7610":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-191","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#qoder-cliqodercliqodercli-cn","content":"**模型繁忙**：`10605` 且 `serviceAvailable` 是调度器的答复。ready 的请求按提示延时重发（有次数上限，并换新的 `request_id`）；真正排队的请求作为带等待时间的限流返回，交由调用方调度。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7611":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-192","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#qoder-cliqodercliqodercli-cn","content":"**Credits**：保留请求级 `usage.credits`、`original_credits`、`billable`，非计费请求的 `charged_credits` 为 0。**余额** 读取账号级周期额度（个人、加量、组织三个桶）；此路径没有每日签到。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7612":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-193","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#qoder-cliqodercliqodercli-cn","content":"**账号字段**：`personal_token`、`access_token`、`security_oauth_token`、`refresh_token`、`uid` / `user_id`、`nickname`、`email`、`machine_id`、`expires_at`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7613":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-194","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#codebuddy--workbuddybuddyworkbuddy","content":"腾讯 CodeBuddy（`buddy`，`copilot.tencent.com`）和 WorkBuddy 国际版（`workbuddy`，`www.workbuddy.ai`）使用同一套协议、不同的主机。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7614":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-195","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#codebuddy--workbuddybuddyworkbuddy","content":"**登录**：`hoshimi login buddy` 或 `hoshimi login workbuddy` 打开外部登录页，网关轮询登录状态，不需要本地回调。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7615":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-196","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#codebuddy--workbuddybuddyworkbuddy","content":"**模型**：CodeBuddy 回退列表 16 个（hy4/hy3、deepseek-v4、glm-5.x、kimi、minimax-m3）；WorkBuddy 23 个（含 `default-model` 等别名、gpt-5.x、gemini-3.5-flash、glm、kimi）。WorkBuddy 会按模型家族切换 User-Agent。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7616":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-197","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#codebuddy--workbuddybuddyworkbuddy","content":"**签到**：只有 CodeBuddy 有每日签到；WorkBuddy 国际版没有签到接口，余额查询仍可用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7617":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-198","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#codebuddy--workbuddybuddyworkbuddy","content":"**账号字段**：`access_token`、`refresh_token`，登录时还会保存 `user_id`、`enterprise_id` 等，余额查询会用到。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7618":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-199","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#codeartscodearts","content":"华为云 CodeArts 的 ModelArts 通道（`snap-access.cn-north-4.myhuaweicloud.com`），请求使用华为云 SDK-HMAC-SHA256 签名。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7619":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-200","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#codeartscodearts","content":"**登录**：`hoshimi login codearts` 打开华为云门户授权页，回调到本机 10000 以上的随机端口（门户拒绝更低的端口），换取令牌时附带 DPoP 证明；回调等待最长 5 分钟，支持手动粘贴回调地址。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7620":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-201","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#codeartscodearts","content":"**凭据**：得到的是带过期时间的临时 AK/SK 和安全令牌。适配器不续期，过期后重新登录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7621":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-202","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#codeartscodearts","content":"**模型**：从站点的内置模型列表发现（排除 `-VL` 模型），失败时回退到 `GLM-5.x`、`deepseek-v4*`、`openpangu-2.0-*` 等。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7622":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-203","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#codeartscodearts","content":"**优惠模型**：`options.benefit_models`（默认 `glm-5.3-flash`、`deepseek-v4.1-flash`）中的模型请求时附带 `maas_type: benefit` 头；站点拒绝该头时自动去掉重试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7623":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-204","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#codeartscodearts","content":"**签到**：领取“每日登录”活动；按 token 计费或非积分计费的账号不在活动范围内。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7624":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-205","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#loomyloomy","content":"讯飞 Loomy（`loomyad.xunfei.cn`），OpenAI 兼容。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7625":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-206","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#loomyloomy","content":"**登录**：`hoshimi login loomy` 在本机启动一个页面显示微信二维码，扫码确认即可。首次使用的微信账号需要在同一页面绑定手机号（获取并填写短信验证码）。页面只在 `127.0.0.1` 上提供，需要用本机浏览器打开。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7626":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-207","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#loomyloomy","content":"**凭据**：会话有效期约 14 天，适配器不续期，到期后重新登录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7627":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-208","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#loomyloomy","content":"**请求**：令牌同时作为 `Authorization: Bearer` 和 `token` 头发送（聊天接口和控制接口各认一个）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7628":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-209","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#loomyloomy","content":"**账号字段**：`access_token`、`userid`、`expires_at`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7629":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-210","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#raccoonraccoon","content":"商汤小浣熊（`xiaohuanxiong.com`），OpenAI 兼容。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7630":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-211","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#raccoonraccoon","content":"**登录**：`hoshimi login raccoon` 打开站点的微信扫码页，由网关轮询结果，不需要本地回调。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7631":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-212","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#raccoonraccoon","content":"**模型**：`sn-sensenova-6-8-flash`、`sn-glm-5-3`、`sn-kimi-k3`、`sn-deepseek-v4-1-flash` 等固定列表。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7632":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-213","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#raccoonraccoon","content":"**账号字段**：`access_token`、`refresh_token`、`device_id`、`office_identity`（组织代码，作为 `X-Org-Code` 发送）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7633":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-214","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#lobsterailobsterai","content":"有道 LobsterAI（`lobsterai-server.youdao.com`），OpenAI 兼容，模型目录从站点实时读取，失败时回退到 19 个内置 ID。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7634":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-215","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#lobsterailobsterai","content":"**登录**：`hoshimi login lobsterai` 打开 `lobsterai.youdao.com` 门户，回调到本机临时端口；支持手动粘贴回调地址。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7635":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-216","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#lobsterailobsterai","content":"**注意**：登录时生成的 `uuid` 和 `firstKeyfrom` 会随续期请求发送，不要从账号中删除，否则续期失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7636":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-217","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#lobsterailobsterai","content":"**账号字段**：`access_token`、`refresh_token`、`uuid`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7637":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-218","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#codexcodex","content":"用 ChatGPT 账号登录的 Codex 通道（`chatgpt.com/backend-api/codex`），走 OpenAI Responses 协议，额度来自 ChatGPT 订阅。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7638":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-219","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#codexcodex","content":"**登录**：`hoshimi login codex` 打开 OpenAI 授权页，回调固定到本机 `localhost:1455`（这是 Codex 客户端注册的回调地址），该端口必须空闲；同一时间只能进行一次 Codex 登录。支持手动粘贴回调地址。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7639":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-220","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#codexcodex","content":"**请求**：系统和 developer 消息合并为 `instructions`，不发送 `max_output_tokens`、`temperature`、`top_p`；账号的 `account_id` 作为 `ChatGPT-Account-Id` 头发送。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7640":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-221","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#codexcodex","content":"**模型**：从账号的模型目录读取，或在账号中用 `models` 声明。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7641":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-222","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#eaceac","content":"EAC 是合租中继：没有匿名模式，只有配置了账号才启用，在 **渠道** 中标记为需要授权。新安装时运行 `hoshimi login eac`（或在 **渠道** 中点 **登录**），通过 GitHub 授权内置中继，成功后创建 `relay: \"bundled\"` 的 `eac-default` 账号；也可以添加自定义的 Worker 中继或 Bearer 直连中继。模型包括 `deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4.1-flash`、`moonshotai/kimi-*`、`z-ai/glm-5.3*`、`openai/gpt-oss-20b`，以及经中继转发的 `opencode/deepseek-v4.1-flash-free`、`opencode/glm-5.3-flash-free`。中继模式、签名和授权文件的细节见 EAC。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7642":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-223","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#zhipuzhipu","content":"智谱 BigModel 开放平台（`open.bigmodel.cn/api/paas/v4`）。它是按密钥接入的固定站点，不是聚合入口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7643":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-224","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#zhipuzhipu","content":"**添加账号**：在 bigmodel.cn 控制台创建 API 密钥，然后在 **渠道** › **Zhipu GLM (BigModel)** 中 **添加账号**，或写入 `config.json`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7644":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-225","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#zhipuzhipu","content":"**模型**：优先读取实时目录（账号余额能覆盖的其他模型也会出现）。目录不可达时回退到 7 个免费 ID：`glm-4.7-flash`、`glm-4.5-flash`、`glm-4-flash-250414`、`glm-z1-flash`、`glm-4.6v-flash`、`glm-4.1v-thinking-flash`、`glm-4v-flash`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7645":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-226","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#zhipuzhipu","content":"**国际站**：`options.base_url` 设为 `https://api.z.ai/api/paas/v4` 可以把整个渠道切到 api.z.ai。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7646":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-227","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#zhipuzhipu","content":"**思考**：没有菜单的文本模型不改动调用方的请求；Z1 和 V-Thinking 这类本身就是思考模型的，使用预算阶梯控制。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7647":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-228","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#续期签到与余额","content":"两个定时任务在 **设置** 中开关：**凭据续期**（`server.auto_refresh`）和 **每日签到**（`server.auto_checkin`），默认都开启。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7648":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-229","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#续期签到与余额","content":"**续期**：网关启动 30 秒后开始，每 30 分钟检查一次，续期一小时内到期、或没有记录到期时间的账号（只处理带 `refresh_token` 的账号）。站点拒绝续期令牌时，账号标记为 **需要登录** 并移出轮换，重新登录后恢复。续期得到的新令牌只写回对应账号。手动续期：渠道详情中的 **立即续期**（整个渠道，或账号菜单中的单个账号），或 **渠道** 页顶部的 **续期所有账户**；接口为 `GET /api/v1/refresh`（查看状态）和 `POST /api/v1/refresh`（立即续期）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7649":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-230","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#续期签到与余额","content":"**签到**：网关启动 30 秒后开始，每天按北京时间日期逐个账号领取一次（串行，避免触发站点风控）。站点回答“今天已领取”也算完成。手动签到：**渠道** 页顶部的 **全部签到**，或渠道详情菜单中的 **立即签到**；**最近签到** 显示该渠道最近的结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7650":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-231","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#续期签到与余额","content":"**余额**：支持的站点可以查询余额或额度。另外，网关会从站点每次响应的限流头中被动读取剩余额度，显示在渠道详情的 **额度** 部分，不产生额外请求。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7651":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-232","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#续期签到与余额","content":"能力","locale":"zh-CN"},"7652":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-233","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#续期签到与余额","content":"支持的渠道","locale":"zh-CN"},"7653":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-234","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#续期签到与余额","content":"续期","locale":"zh-CN"},"7654":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-235","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#续期签到与余额","content":"`cline`、`gemini`、`minimax`、`trae`、`qoder`、`qodercn`、`qodercli`、`qodercli-cn`、`buddy`、`workbuddy`、`raccoon`、`lobsterai`、`codex`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7655":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-236","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#续期签到与余额","content":"每日签到","locale":"zh-CN"},"7656":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-237","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#续期签到与余额","content":"`minimax`、`trae`、`qoder`、`qodercn`、`buddy`、`codearts`、`loomy`、`lobsterai`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7657":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-238","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#续期签到与余额","content":"余额查询","locale":"zh-CN"},"7658":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-239","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#续期签到与余额","content":"`cline`、`gemini`（额度窗口）、`minimax`、`trae`、`qoder`、`qodercn`、`qodercli`、`qodercli-cn`、`buddy`、`workbuddy`、`codearts`、`loomy`、`raccoon`、`lobsterai`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7659":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-240","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#续期签到与余额","content":"相关接口见管理接口，界面操作见渠道页面。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7660":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-241","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#其他支持登录的渠道","content":"以下按密钥计费的服务也支持 `hoshimi login`，细节见各自页面：","locale":"zh-CN"},"7661":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-242","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#其他支持登录的渠道","content":"渠道","locale":"zh-CN"},"7662":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-243","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#其他支持登录的渠道","content":"登录方式","locale":"zh-CN"},"7663":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-244","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#其他支持登录的渠道","content":"页面","locale":"zh-CN"},"7664":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-245","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#其他支持登录的渠道","content":"`anthropic`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7665":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-246","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#其他支持登录的渠道","content":"claude.ai 授权，本地回调（可粘贴 `code#state`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"7666":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-247","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#其他支持登录的渠道","content":"本地与兼容端点","locale":"zh-CN"},"7667":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-248","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-stations#其他支持登录的渠道","content":"`openai`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7668":{"id":"/docs/providers-stations-249","page_id":"/docs/providers-stations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr