e**, **Needs attention**, **Not set up** and **Off**; choose a channel and its accounts, today's usage, allowance and network settings open beside the list, with a **Sign in** or **Add account** button","locale":"en"},"12017":{"id":"/en/docs/first-run-54","page_id":"/en/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/first-run#the-pages","content":"Channels","locale":"en"},"12018":{"id":"/en/docs/first-run-55","page_id":"/en/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/first-run#the-pages","content":"**Usage**","locale":"en"},"12019":{"id":"/en/docs/first-run-56","page_id":"/en/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/first-run#the-pages","content":"Until a request has gone through the gateway it says **Nothing has been served yet**. After that, tokens, cache, latency and every call by 24 hours, 7 days, 30 days, 90 days or a single day","locale":"en"},"12020":{"id":"/en/docs/first-run-57","page_id":"/en/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/first-run#the-pages","content":"Usage","locale":"en"},"12021":{"id":"/en/docs/first-run-58","page_id":"/en/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/first-run#the-pages","content":"**Playground**","locale":"en"},"12022":{"id":"/en/docs/first-run-59","page_id":"/en/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/first-run#the-pages","content":"An empty chat (**What can I help with?**) with a model already chosen. The built-in tools are all on by default, with **Automatic review** judging commands and file edits before they run","locale":"en"},"12023":{"id":"/en/docs/first-run-60","page_id":"/en/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/first-run#the-pages","content":"Playground","locale":"en"},"12024":{"id":"/en/docs/first-run-61","page_id":"/en/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/first-run#the-pages","content":"**Settings**","locale":"en"},"12025":{"id":"/en/docs/first-run-62","page_id":"/en/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type"