headline-tiles","content":"While calls are running, **Running now (N)** appears under the tiles with a card per call, the same as Live activity in the top bar.","locale":"en"},"13021":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-usage-53","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-usage#tokens-over-time","content":"A stacked bar chart shows tokens per hour or per day by kind: **Uncached input**, **Cache read**, **Cache write**, **Output** and **Reasoning** (output other than reasoning counts as **Output**). Hover a bar for each kind and the **Total**.","locale":"en"},"13022":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-usage-54","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-usage#tokens-over-time","content":"**24 hours** and **Day** are by the hour; hours of today still to come are drawn faint, not as a fall to zero.","locale":"en"},"13023":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-usage-55","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-usage#tokens-over-time","content":"**7 days**, **30 days** and **90 days** are by the day. Click a day's bar to open that day hour by hour (**Choose a day to see its hours**).","locale":"en"},"13024":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-usage-56","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-usage#tokens-over-time","content":"Hourly detail is kept for 120 days. An older day shows **Hour-by-hour detail is not kept for this day. The totals above still include it.**","locale":"en"},"13025":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-usage-57","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-usage#speed","content":"When there are measurements, two line charts appear: **Time to first token** and **Decode speed (tok/s)**, both averages per bucket; buckets without a measurement are left as gaps rather than drawn as zero.","locale":"en"},"13026":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-usage-58","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-usage#speed","content":"Ca