icy_blocked`"],[11231,"`policy_blocked`"],[3431,"`PolicyBlocked`"],[11230,"`PolicyBlocked`"],[6860,"`poolside`"],[6861,"`poolside`"],[7350,"`poolside`"],[14657,"`poolside`"],[14658,"`poolside`"],[15147,"`poolside`"],[8062,"`POST /api/v1/models/unavailable/reset` or a server restart clears every record."],[263,"`POST /api/v1/models/unavailable/reset` 或重启服务器清除所有记录。"],[1336,"`POST /attachments`"],[9135,"`POST /attachments`"],[1348,"`POST /chat/completions`"],[9147,"`POST /chat/completions`"],[9476,"`POST /chat/completions` takes an OpenAI Chat Completions request (see OpenAI-compatible API) and answers like `/v1/chat/completions`, but with the tool access key instead of the model API key, and recorded in Usage under the `playground` origin. `playground.system_prompt` goes first unless the request has a `system` or `developer` message. Nothing is kept as a conversation."],[1677,"`POST /chat/completions` 接受 OpenAI Chat Completions 请求（见 OpenAI 兼容 API），响应与 `/v1/chat/completions` 相同，但使用工具访问密钥而不是模型 API 密钥，并以 `playground` 来源记录在用量中。请求中没有 `system` 或 `developer` 消息时，先发送 `playground.system_prompt`。不会保存为对话。"],[1312,"`POST /conversations/{id}/approvals/{call_id}`"],[9111,"`POST /conversations/{id}/approvals/{call_id}`"],[1324,"`POST /conversations/{id}/branch`"],[9123,"`POST /conversations/{id}/branch`"],[9473,"`POST /conversations/{id}/branch` with `{\"message_id\": \"...\"}` creates a conversation holding the path up to that message, under new ids, with the same title, model, effort and approval mode, and `branched_from` set. Answers `201` with the full conversation."],[1674,"`POST /conversations/{id}/branch`，请求体 `{\"message_id\": \"...\"}`，新建一个对话，包含截至该消息的路径（使用新的 ID），沿用标题、模型、推理强度和审批模式，并设置 `branched_from`。返回 `201` 和完整对话。"],[1330,"`POST /conversations/{id}/compact`"],[9129,"`POST /conversations/{id}/compact`"],[9470,"`POST /conversations/{id}/compact` compacts the conversation now, with an optional `instructions` (what the summary should pay attention to). It streams `checkpoint` (the checkpoint message as filed, its step `running`) and `done` (as kept). A `done` with `status` `error` means it failed and the conversation is as it was; closing the connection stops it the same way. It answers `409` while a reply is running and `400` when there is nothing to compact (no reply since the last compaction). Send the next question with the checkpoint's id as `parent_id`."],[1671,"`POST /conversations/{id}/compact` 立即压缩对话，可附带 `instructions`（总结应关注的内容）。它依次推送 `checkpoint`（保存后的检查点消息，步骤状态为 `running`）和 `done`（最终保存的结果）。`done` 的 `status` 为 `error` 表示失败，对话保持原样；断开连接也会同样停止。有回复正在运行时返回 `409`，没有可压缩的内容（上次压缩后没有新回复）时返回 `400`。下一个问题以检查点的 ID 作为 `parent_id` 发送。"],[1300,"`POST /conversations/{id}/messages/{message_id}/retry`"],[9099,"`POST /conversations/{id}/messages/{message_id}/retry`"],[9361,"`POST /conversations/{id}/messages/{message_id}/retry` streams another reply, with the same events except `user`. `message_id` is a reply (the new one goes beside it) or a question left unanswered (it gets its first reply)."],[1562,"`POST /conversations/{id}/messages/{message_id}/retry` 流式生成另一条回复，事件与发送相同，只是没有 `user`。`message_id` 可以是一条回复（新回复与它并列），也可以是一个还没有回复的问题（为它生成第一条回复）。"],[1297,"`POST /conversations/{id}/messages`"],[9096,"`POST /conversations/{id}/messages`"],[9294,"`POST /conversations/{id}/messages` adds a question and streams the reply."],[1495,"`POST /conversations/{id}/messages` 添加一个问题并流式返回回复。"],[1315,"`POST /conversations/{id}/steer`"],[9114,"`POST /conversations/{id}/steer`"],[9429,"`POST /conversations/{id}/steer` with `{\"content\": \"...\"}` sends a message to the reply under way, without stopping it. It answers `202` with `{\"id\": \"steer_…\"}`."],[1630,"`POST /conversations/{id}/steer`，请求体 `{\"content\": \"...\"}`，向正在进行的回复发送消息而不停止它。返回 `202` 和 `{\"id\": \"steer_…\"}`。"],[1309,"`POST /conversations/{id}/stop`"],[9108,"`POST /conversations/{id}/stop`"],[9357,"`POST /conversations/{id}/stop` stops it: a running tool is told to stop, a waiting approval is dropped, and the reply is kept as `stopped` with what came so far. Every stream following it ends with that `done`."],[1558,"`POST /conversations/{id}/stop` 停止回复：正在运行的工具被要求停止，等待中的批准被取消，回复连同已生成的内容保存为 `stopped`。所有跟随它的流都以这个 `done` 结束。"],[1327,"`POST /conversations/{id}/title`"],[9126,"`POST /conversations/{id}/title`"],[9472,"`POST /conversations/{id}/title` has a model name the conversation after its first exchange, and waits for it. The model is `playground.title_model`, else the conversation's own. A temporary conversation, one titled by a model already, and one with your own title are left as they are; if the model fails, the title stays. Answers the summary."],[1673,"`POST /conversations/{id}/title` 让模型根据第一轮问答为对话命名，并等待模型完成。使用 `playground.title_model`，未设置则用对话自身的模型。临时对话、已由模型命名的对话和你自己设置了标题的对话保持不变；模型调用失败时标题也不变。返回对话摘要。"],[1285,"`POST /conversations`"],[9084,"`POST /conversations`"],[921,"`POST /credits/claim`"],[1029,"`POST /credits/claim`"],[8720,"`POST /credits/claim`"],[8828,"`POST /credits/claim`"],[931,"`POST /login/cancel`"],[8730,"`POST /login/cancel`"],[929,"`POST /login/input`"],[8728,"`POST /login/input`"],[925,"`POST /login/start`"],[8724,"`POST /login/start`"],[907,"`POST /models/unavailable/reset`"],[8706,"`POST /models/unavailable/reset`"],[8813,"`POST /models/unavailable/reset` lets every held-out model back in and returns `{\"cleared\": <count>}`."],[1014,"`POST /models/unavailable/reset` 解除所有被暂时停用的模型，返回 `{\"cleared\": <数量>}`。"],[911,"`POST /probe`"],[8710,"`POST /probe`"],[8815,"`POST /probe` starts a round in the background; the body is optional:"],[1016,"`POST /probe` 在后台开始一轮探测，请求体可选："],[893,"`POST /providers/{provider_id}/accounts`"],[8692,"`POST /providers/{provider_id}/accounts`"],[8777,"`POST /providers/{provider_id}/accounts` appends one account; the `account` in the body is exactly what you would write in `config.json`:"],[978,"`POST /providers/{provider_id}/accounts` 追加一个账号，请求体中的 `account` 与写在 `config.json` 里的形式完全相同："],[915,"`POST /refresh`"],[8714,"`POST /