d's result"],[11083,"Class attributes"],[8353,"Classification"],[8876,"Classification"],[6131,"classifier"],[13928,"classifier"],[2221,"Claude Code"],[10020,"Claude Code"],[8648,"Claude Code gateway compatibility"],[10062,"Claude Code sends `thinking: {\"type\": \"adaptive\"}` and `output_config.effort`. Native forwarding passes them to the upstream; conversion maps them onto the model's effort levels."],[10031,"Claude Code speaks Anthropic Messages. Point its Base URL at Hoshimi and its requests go to Hoshimi's `/v1/messages`, authenticated with the gateway's model API key; upstream account credentials stay in Hoshimi."],[2263,"Claude Code 发送 `thinking: {\"type\": \"adaptive\"}` 和 `output_config.effort`。原生转发时原样交给上游；转换时换算成该模型的推理强度。"],[2243,"Claude Code 的后台请求使用 Haiku 别名，另外还有 Sonnet、Opus 两个别名。别名指向的模型 id 在 Hoshimi 中找不到时，请求会报路由错误。把 `ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_HAIKU_MODEL` 指向网关里存在的模型，后台请求就会固定到它；用到 Sonnet、Opus 别名时也同样设置："],[2230,"Claude Code 的请求如何被处理"],[2246,"Claude Code 的选择器只显示 id 中含 `claude` 或 `anthropic` 的模型。其他模型请用 `--model`、`ANTHROPIC_MODEL` 或上面的别名变量显式指定；Hoshimi 不会把其他模型改名伪装成 Claude。"],[849,"Claude Code 网关兼容性"],[2232,"Claude Code 说的是 Anthropic Messages 协议，把它的 Base URL 指向 Hoshimi，它的请求就会走 Hoshimi 的 `/v1/messages`。用的是网关的模型 API 密钥，上游账号的凭据留在 Hoshimi 中。"],[2267,"Claude Code 遇到不认识的模型 id 时会提示它假定 200k 的上下文窗口，这只是 Claude Code 自己的提示。"],[10042,"Claude Code's background requests use its Haiku alias, and it has Sonnet and Opus aliases as well. When an alias points to a model id Hoshimi does not have, the request fails with a routing error. Point `ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_HAIKU_MODEL` at a model the gateway has to pin background requests to it, and do the same for the Sonnet and Opus aliases when you use them:"],[10045,"Claude Code's picker only shows ids that contain `claude` or `anthropic`. Name other models explicitly with `--model`, `ANTHROPIC_MODEL` or the alias variables above; Hoshimi does not rename other models to pass them off as Claude."],[15462,"claude.ai consent, local callback (`code#sta