el in Hoshimi. Name the station with `preset` instead of writing its address:"],[8202,"Stations refusing images or tools"],[8283,"Stations that need a local callback listen on `127.0.0.1`: Codex always uses port 1455 (a busy port gives `codex: cannot bind the local callback port 1455: …`; `codex: another login is already in progress` means another Codex login has not finished), and Cline's browser method uses 48801–48811 (`cline: no available callback port (48801–48811)`). Close whatever holds those ports and retry."],[15245,"Stations that need a local callback listen only on `127.0.0.1` (or `localhost`) for the duration of the sign-in, never on a public interface. When the browser is on another machine, paste the callback with `--manual` or the Web UI's **Authorization code or callback URL**. The one flow without manual input (Loomy) has to be finished in a browser on the same machine."],[8133,"Stations that need a login: sign in again"],[8723,"Stations that offer an interactive sign-in"],[8143,"Stations that sign in through a browser, such as Cline, Qoder and ZCode, need one new login with `hoshimi login <channel>` or **Sign in** in the Web UI; see Free stations."],[9787,"Stations with an interactive login: `anthropic`, `buddy`, `cline`, `codearts`, `codex`, `eac`, `gemini`, `github-copilot`, `kilo`, `kimi-coding`, `lobsterai`, `loomy`, `meta`, `minimax`, `openai`, `openrouter`, `qoder`, `qodercn`, `qodercli`, `qodercli-cn`, `raccoon`, `radius`, `trae`, `workbuddy`, `xai`, `zcode`."],[11106,"Stations with their own protocol, authentication or quirks (Cline, TRAE, ZCode, Qoder, MiniMax, Gemini, CodeBuddy, Kilo, OpenCode…)"],[9542,"Status"],[9570,"Status"],[8233,"Status and code"],[8181,"Status classification"],[12071,"Steer a reply while it works"],[9065,"Steering"],[5562,"StepFun"],[13359,"StepFun"],[9063,"Steps"],[12312,"Still serving, but something wants a human: an account needs a new login, a token has expired, an account is held out of rotation, or the channe