el denied it; the model reads why"],[12211,"The review model is judging it"],[12169,"The reviewer is sent:"],[12433,"The route covers every request the gateway makes for this channel: model catalogue, inference, login, token refresh, balance and check-in. Once saved, a proxy address is never shown again, only **Proxy configured; save to replace it.** A proxy that cannot be reached never falls back to a direct connection."],[12925,"The route is used for every request the gateway makes: model catalogue, inference, login, token refresh, balance, check-in, and the PyPI version check. A proxy address may hold a user name and password, so once saved the interface only says **Proxy configured; save to replace it.** A proxy that cannot be reached never falls back to a direct connection. Changes apply to new requests; streams already running finish on their original connections."],[9072,"The routes are part of the management API (see Management API):"],[9640,"The running server has its own Swagger UI (`/docs`) and OpenAPI document (`/openapi.json`) listing every endpoint's fields; they are the authoritative reference. These pages explain usage; `/docs` describes structure."],[9076,"The running server's `/docs` and `/openapi.json` list every field (see API overview)."],[9854,"The running server's host, actual port, URL and PID"],[8186,"The same 10 minutes and 3 strikes; in memory only, cleared by a restart or `POST /api/v1/models/unavailable/reset`"],[15575,"The same checks from the command line"],[8191,"The same header order, lenient number parsing"],[13393,"The same ID at two stations can be two different models at two different prices, so the gateway records which station each ID came from:"],[8010,"The same level when the menu has it; otherwise `minimal` becomes `low`"],[8019,"The same level when the menu has it; otherwise `xhigh` becomes `max`"],[8595,"The same level; `max` becomes `xhigh`"],[12344,"The same logins work from the command line, which suits a server without